ent files and invoked skill bodies (5k cap each) [CC-CTX]. Rewind menu can \"summarize from/up to here\" [CC-CKPT]. `--continue/--resume`, `/branch`, `--fork-session`; resume-from-summary dialog for idle >1h, >100k-token sessions [CC-SESS]. CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, auto memory [CC-OV]. Subagent `autoCompactWindow` (2.1.296) [CC-CHG]. | `compaction.auto` (default true), `compaction.prune` (old tool outputs, default false), `compaction.reserved` token buffer [OC-CFG]. Per-model `limit.context/output` for custom providers [OC-PROV]. `instructions` file globs [OC-CFG]. | Auto-compact at min(80% of window, 225k tokens) (`GOOSE_AUTO_COMPACT_THRESHOLD`/`_TOKEN_LIMIT`); `/compact`; fallback strategies summarize/truncate/clear/prompt (`GOOSE_CONTEXT_STRATEGY`); headless defaults to summarize [GS-CTX]. | Ollama: warns 2k default ctx \"silently discards context\"; aider sets `num_ctx` to fit each request + 8k reply [AI-OLLAMA]. (No compaction feature verified this session.) |\ndocs/reviews/evidence/qualification_2026-10-12/peers.md:56:8. After compaction, project instructions (AGENTS.md-equivalent) and recently edited files are re-injected [CC-CTX].\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:3:These rules apply to every agent (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Nexus itself, or a human) that implements any part of this package at the same time as another. The repository's root `AGENTS.md` points here. The rules come from incidents recorded in `tasks/lessons.md`:\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":10135056}},"started_at_ms":1792853254655,"completed_at_ms":1792853254666}}
