{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:48:09.937Z","ordinal":293887,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcc528c60481a08a7d1719487b934b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Got it: the missing behavior is the **interactive “Trust this folder?” prompt before Nexus loads project instructions such as `AGENTS.md`**.\n\nI checked the latest `origin/main` and the published RC4 source: that prompt is present. It offers **Trust and continue**, **Continue without trusting**, and **Exit**. A folder already saved as trusted skips the prompt. When Nexus starts without an interactive terminal, it prints an untrusted-workspace notice instead of showing the chooser.\n\nIf you’re launching RC1, it predates this change; RC4 is the first release candidate I verified with the prompt. I haven’t changed the shared checkout."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792853288800,"completed_at_ms":1792853289937}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:48:09.941Z","ordinal":293888,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcc528c60481a08a7d1719487b934b","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Got it: the missing behavior is the **interactive “Trust this folder?” prompt before Nexus loads project instructions such as `AGENTS.md`**.\n\nI checked the latest `origin/main` and the published RC4 source: that prompt is present. It offers **Trust and continue**, **Continue without trusting**, and **Exit**. A folder already saved as trusted skips the prompt. When Nexus starts without an interactive terminal, it prints an untrusted-workspace notice instead of showing the chooser.\n\nIf you’re launching RC1, it predates this change; RC4 is the first release candidate I verified with the prompt. I haven’t changed the shared checkout.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","create_time":1792853288.7762191,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcc528c60481a08a7d1719487b934b","turn_id":"01a16e58-0fa9-73b3-824f-571bf4a9cd42","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a16e62-2bd5-7021-8e86-7eb142cfc715","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15062}}
