d\nFILE_docs_CLIENT_GUIDE.md\nFILE_docs_REPOSITORY_QUALITY.md\nFILE_docs_USER_MANUAL.md\nFILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.3_terminal_installed-identity-20261024T0133Z\nREDACTED.md\nREDACTED.md\nFILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_plan-10-host-preflight-current\nFILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_qualification_rc.3_providers_e5-openrouter-live-task-20261023.json\nFILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_qualification_rc.3_providers_e5-provider-verification-20261023T1659Z.json\nFILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_qualification_rc.3_providers_provider-receipts-20261023T1659Z.jsonl\nFILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md\nFILE_docs_v1.0.0_ROADMAP.md\nFILE_docs_v1.0.0_TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md\nFILE_docs_v1.0.0_plans_PLAN-01-safe-execution-defaults.md\nFILE_docs_v1.0.0_plans_PLAN-C1-contest-submission-track.md\nFILE_docs_v1.0.0_specs_SPEC-C1-contest-submission-track.md\nFILE_experiments_cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice_agent-collab-worker_package.json\nFILE_experiments_cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice_fork-worker_package.json\nFILE_scripts_generate_sbom.sh\nFILE_scripts_package-linux.sh\nFILE_scripts_release-tools_package-lock.json\nFILE_scripts_release-tools_package.json\nFILE_scripts_repro-identity.mjs\nPLAN-05_PR-5B_CODEQL_CLIENT_NORMALIZE\nPLAN-08_TASK1_HOME_ISOLATION_TEST\nPLAN-10_HOST_PREFLIGHT_CURRENT_SOURCE\nPLAN-12_INDEPENDENT_CLOSURE_REVIEW\nPLAN-C1_POST_CONTEST_STATUS_AND_DEPENDENCY_COVERAGE\nPOST_CONTEST_DEP_UPDATE_PR126\nRELEASE_PUBLISHER\nREPRO_CROSS_RUNNER_BUNDLE_20261024\nREPRO_TAR_METADATA_20261024\nSEC_CODEQL_CLIENT_REGEX\nSEC_CODEQL_PGREP_PATTERN\nSEC_CODEQL_PROVIDER_CLI_REDACTION\nSEC_DEMO_GIT_CLEANUP_RACE\nSUITE\narchive\narchived\n\n--- repro worktree ---\n## v1/repro-crossrunner-bundle\n585a675fc616cea5d72c8166bf6b47bab3c46540\n72e769348fe8a978a576627a4802cb6b68ced779\n scripts/package-linux.sh | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++--\n 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\n{\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"},\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"## Defect\\n\\n`file_info` is the metadata tool, but for every regular file it `mmap`s the whole file and iterates every byte to compute `line_count`, with no `MAX_READ_BYTES` check. `read_file` refuses files above 8 MB unless paged; `file_info` would still scan a multi-gigabyte file, blocking the single Rust bridge and faulting pages into memory.\\n\\nPre-fix probe on an 8 MB + 1 file returned `line_count: Some(8388609)`.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nOnly compute `line_count`/binary detection when the file is within `MAX_READ_BYTES`, the same limit the read tool uses. Larger files still report `size_bytes`, type, permissions and timestamps, with `line_count: None` (already the case for binary/unreadable files).\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- New regression fails pre-fix (`Some(8388609) != None`) and passes now.\\n- `cargo test --bin harness-core file_ops::` 16/16; full `cargo test --bin harness-core` 35/35.\\n- `git diff --check`: pass.\\n- Evidence: `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/DEFECT-FILE-INFO-UNBOUNDED-20261024/README.md`.\\n\\n## Residuals\\n\\nNo line count above 8 MB (use `read_file --offset/--length` or `wc -l`); mmap/SIGBUS on concurrent truncation and whole-file `edit_file`/`patch_file` are pre-existing and out of scope.\\n\\n## Coordination\\n\\nTook over the stale `FILE_core_src_file_ops.rs` claim (owner branch merged as PR #52, no PID, 6 days old; recorded as BROKEN_CLAIM). Independent review and exact-head CI to follow.\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/defect-file-info-unbounded\",\"headRefOid\":\"99f2e3698441b6061e08a18fbd93cac5f93bd51d\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"number\":195,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"title\":\"fix(file_info): bound line counting by the read limit\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T14:32:10Z\"}\nlinux-x86_64\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40102765072/job/120902044451\t\nCodeQL\tpass\t4s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/120898383713\t\nCodeRabbit\tpass\t0\t\tReview skipped: manual review required for this OSS repository\njavascript-typescript\tpass\t1m13s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40102765052/job/120898130639\t\ntest-matrix (22)\tpass\t16m44s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40102765072/job/120898130792\t\ntest-matrix (24)\tpass\t17m38s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40102765072/job/120898130795\t\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e62-7365-74b3-a660-6c02335c1b7f","create_time":1792853343.548725}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
