{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:51:07.858Z","ordinal":294033,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcc5d8445081a0940910f0ac417100","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ba881761ceaf44b3835c0c5ca2441365","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /var/tmp/nexus-pr-crossrunner-bundle.md <<'EOF'\\n## Reproduced release blocker\\n\\nCross-runner qualification for the published `v1.0.0-rc.4` was dispatched from exact `main` revision `72e769348fe8a978a576627a4802cb6b68ced779` in workflow run `40103980794`. Both Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds completed, but the comparison failed because the generated Linux archives differed at byte 19. Their compatibility metadata matched. This leaves `REQ-REL-114` unqualified for RC4.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nGenerate the package archive with the pinned build container so host-specific tar metadata does not affect output bytes. The change preserves package payload, version, and compatibility metadata.\\n\\n## Candidate\\n\\n- Head: `585a675fc616cea5d72c8166bf6b47bab3c46540`\\n- Base: `72e769348fe8a978a576627a4802cb6b68ced779`\\n- Scope: `scripts/package-linux.sh` only\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT by `plan05_readonly_review` at this exact candidate; patch SHA-256 `a34a2211eef52d580c6e300b2ce88b7115b23e4cf60fb011b896af4cd009f20`\\n- Static checks: `bash -n` and `git diff --check` pass\\n\\nNo local test suite was run because the repository's `SUITE` claim remains held by `KimiCode-defect-scan`. Exact-head hosted CI and a fresh cross-runner RC4 comparison are required. RC4 itself remains immutable; this PR cannot retroactively make its failed reproduction pass.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/repro-crossrunner-bundle --title \\\"fix(release): normalize package archives across runners\\\" --body-file /var/tmp/nexus-pr-crossrunner-bundle.md\\ngh pr view --json number,url,headRefOid,baseRefOid,reviewDecision,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup --jq '{number,url,headRefOid,baseRefOid,reviewDecision,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup}'\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":2000}); text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e62-7365-74b3-a660-6c02335c1b7f","create_time":1792853464.2700796}}}
