{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T15:11:48.124Z","ordinal":294717,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adccaa9412881a0a591141fa38e5272","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ab1cf539eadb48eca6403e095f4b3c5c","name":"exec","input":"const updates = [\n  {list:\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\", fields:{\n    current_exact_main:\"origin/main advanced after PR #195 merge to e624de04ca6ddebc3b08bf8e13375011d227c7e8 at 2026-10-24T15:06Z; origin/v1/integration is 7d6673f, an ancestor 303 commits behind.\",\n    rc4:\"Published prerelease v1.0.0-rc.4, source 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169, archive sha256 07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806; not accepted.\",\n    requirements:\"At exact main 72e7693 before PR195, isolated detached worktree: scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce PASS, 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals); sync-version --check --tag rc.4 PASS. Must rerun on current main e624de0.\",\n    rc4_crossrunner:\"Run 40103980794 on workflow commit 72e7693 failed cross-runner comparison. Ubuntu22 archive sha 07867e... matches published RC4; Ubuntu24 archive sha ce3ca76c... differs. Downloaded artifacts show extracted package trees identical and identical MANIFEST.sha256; first tar header's unused device-number field encoding differs.\",\n    pr196:\"PR #196 https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/196, head 585a675fc616cea5d72c8166bf6b47bab3c46540, base 72e769348fe8a978a576627a4802cb6b68ced779. Independent review ACCEPT exact head; diff is scripts/package-linux.sh only. CodeQL, JS/TS, Node22 and Node24 checks pass; Linux package check is in progress. Main moved to e624de0 after PR195, so rebase and repeat exact-head checks before merge.\",\n    current_main_ci:\"Post-PR195 CI run 40105438204 on e624de04ca6ddebc3b08bf8e13375011d227c7e8 and CodeQL run 40105438209: CodeQL PASS; Node22 and Node24 full suites in progress. Earlier main CI 40103947553 at 72e: Node22/24 PASS, Linux packaging in progress.\",\n    startup_trust:\"Actual installed RC4 57b9285 on ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 displayed the trust chooser in an SSH forced-TTY probe using an isolated HOME and temporary workspace with AGENTS.md; Escape exited, no trust was persisted. This is narrow startup evidence, not the 15-cell manual terminal matrix. The real /home/mike/nexus-code path is absent on ubuntu-desktop.\",\n    acceptance_status:\"IN_PROGRESS; no accepted RC or stable release.\"\n  }},\n  {list:\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\", fields:{\n    task:\"Integrate PR196 reproducibility fix and construct/qualify the next correctly versioned RC\", status:\"doing\", details:\"RC4 cross-runner exact comparison failed on tar header metadata; PR196 exact-head CI is active. Main moved from 72e to e624de0 after PR195; rebase only after current checks reach terminal, get exact-head re-review/checks, merge through required flow, then pass source gates and create next RC under existing authorization.\"\n  }},\n  {list:\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\", fields:{\n    task:\"Complete RC-bound provider and standalone qualification\", status:\"todo\", details:\"RC4 ChatGPT E5 verify passed 3/3; OpenRouter failed AUTH_FAILURE because no credential was available in isolated allowed sources. User asked asynchronously about making auth available for next exact RC. Standalone T2 subset requires accepted held-out corpus; do not use pilot tasks as held-out evidence.\"\n  }},\n  {list:\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\", fields:{\n    task:\"Obtain independent held-out custody acceptance and complete T2/T3/T4\", status:\"todo\", details:\"Public issue #1 metadata has repeated coordinator requests through 2026-10-24T02:16:57Z and no custodian reply. No private payload accessed. Current T2 legacy validator shape is incompatible with blackbox-v1. Require custodian-owned adaptation/supersession, revalidation, private digests/access boundary and immutable custody acceptance before qualification.\"\n  }},\n  {list:\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\", fields:{\n    task:\"Complete 15-cell human terminal matrix on the exact eligible RC\", status:\"doing\", details:\"Ubuntu/GNOME host 10.0.8.3 is connected; xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal and GNOME Terminal are installed. Human evidence remains 0/15; two screenshots and a verdict per each of 5 terminals × 3 sizes. Automated PTY/probe does not count.\"\n  }},\n  {list:\"nexus-v1-release-convergence\", fields:{\n    task:\"Obtain independent exact-RC acceptance and publish/verify stable v1.0.0\", status:\"todo\", details:\"Publication authorization remains granted but gated. Requires all exact-RC gates, held-out/custody, provider/standalone, T3/T4, long-task/fault-injection, cross-runner, manual terminal, independent review, version-only stable commit, draft artifact verification, then publish and verify GitHub installer artifacts.\"\n  }}\n];\nconst out=[];\nfor (const u of updates) {\n  const r = await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write(u);\n  out.push(r);\n}\ntext(out.map(x=>JSON.stringify(x)).join(\"\\n\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e62-7365-74b3-a660-6c02335c1b7f","create_time":1792854697.2568889}}}
