d the legacy T2 format is incompatible with the current runner. No private payloads were accessed and qualification has not started.\n- RC4’s ChatGPT verification passed 3/3. OpenRouter failed with `AUTH_FAILURE` because no approved credential was available. I asked how you want to make OpenRouter auth available for the next RC; please don’t send a key here.\n- The real-terminal matrix remains **0/15**. It must be completed with operator evidence on the exact eligible RC; automated PTY runs do not count.\n\nNext I’ll finish the active CI checks, rebase and validate PR #196, rerun source gates on the updated main, and continue toward the next RC.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16e62-7365-74b3-a660-6c02335c1b7f","create_time":1792855271.122915,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adccce71e9481a0aa2df186107c6e86","turn_id":"01a16e62-7365-74b3-a660-6c02335c1b7f","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a16e80-77a0-76c2-a29f-23cde69e1e0c","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15102}}
