flow pin PR candidate remains clean at 1fced30 with independent ACCEPT; wait, then rebase after integration and exact-main checks., rc4_publication=Public prerelease v1.0.0-rc.4; tag peels to 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow40090364770 SUCCESS 2026-10-24T11:54:37Z. Archive SHA256 07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806 matches GitHub and SHA256SUMS; SLSA attestation verified for release.yml and source tag. Extracted manifest PASS; binary reports 1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285). Installed published package to isolated prefix on ubuntu-desktop; installer record source/digest and installed manifest match. This is construction/install smoke only, not RC acceptance., rc4_cross_runner=Exact RC4 cross-runner workflow40092008160 passed tag resolution on current main b024027 and is building the tagged source57b9285 on Ubuntu22.04 and 24.04; comparisons pending., heldout_blocker=Fresh public issue #1 check at 2026-10-24T12:25Z shows no custodian response since 02:16:57Z; no author/custodian claim or acknowledged handoff, Agent Mail has zero active window identities. T2 legacy hidden.command remains incompatible with blackbox-v1 runner. No private payloads accessed and no qualification started. This is an external custodian dependency; existing metadata requests should not be spammed., pr183_handoff=PR183 owner RubyBridge asked at 2026-10-24T11:49:03Z to confirm active refresh or safe-boundary claim transfer; no reply yet. Claim remains protected., new_release_blocker=Main b0240273 cross-runner reproducibility workflow run 40092008160 failed at startup: .github/workflows/repro.yml pins actions/download-artifact to upload-artifact commit ea165f..., which GitHub cannot resolve. Verified actions/download-artifact v4 tag SHA d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093. Need separate claimed workflow fix after PR192 slice., pr192_review=GitHub comment by mikeholownych at 11:44:43Z: ACCEPT on exact PR diff, reports focused repl_approval_e2e.test.ts 1/1 pass in isolated HOME in 28.4s and clean diff/merge tree. Hosted linux-x86_64 full job still running., pr192=Merged by owner at 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Exact PR checks all PASS and exact-head independent ACCEPT. Claims released., pr192_rebase_review=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed exact rebased head 03a8db1 against b0240273; diff SHA 70e4eef... unchanged. Fresh exact-head CI in progress., hosted_ci=Exact-head PR192: CodeQL PASS; JS/TS PASS; Node22 PASS (15m59s); Node24 PASS (16m47s). linux-x86_64 packaging job now compiling Rust release binaries., next_action=Monitor PR196 exact CI and main post-merge CI. If PR196 merges and checks pass, dispatch cross-runner again for RC4. Keep final release acceptance blocked on held-out custodian and real terminal/operator gates., pr192_integration=PR #192 merged 2026-10-24T12:55:47Z as 13f25f40bc3a251fafa1c08b3f6d4d9c22d463ef. Its exact head 03a8db1 CI40093263785 all green (Node22/24/Linux package/repro), CodeQL passed, independent review ACCEPT. Post-merge main CI40095968632 and CodeQL40095968617 are running., repro_action_fix=Candidate rebased onto exact main 13f25f40 at b9999ca029fb0a605e523b90eef11d962ec39910; exact net two-line download-artifact pin diff unchanged; independent reviewer reconfirmed ACCEPT, diff SHA-256 cedb7c7afd856e8236ed29182a1a535e6f715c02c62a1469f8a210f491912a29. actionlint and diff-check pass. Waiting current postmerge main and unrelated active PR test runs before push/open PR., workflow_fix=PR194 merged by owner at 2026-10-24T14:45:47Z as 72e769348fe8a978a576627a4802cb6b68ced779. Exact CI passed (CodeQL, JS/TS, Node22/24, Linux); independent ACCEPT carried by unchanged patch identity. Claims released. RC4 cross-runner workflow dispatch40003980794 is in progress on main., main_postmerge_ci=Run40098339766 on PR193 merge be2cd2f: Node24 PASS; Node22 full CLI suite active; CodeQL40098339763 PASS., packaging_repro_fix=Candidate commit 6e79dc7e8ebb51bcbbfc389f4e