4T15:06Z. origin/v1/integration=7d6673f, 303 commits behind and not the current release branch., pre_rc_source_gate=At exact clean detached snapshot a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc, with HOME/XDG isolated and Node24.11.1, node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce passed: 123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals. node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.4 passed. Must rerun on merge main 57b9285 after post-merge workflows pass; source-readiness only., acceptance_status=IN_PROGRESS; RC4 is published but not accepted; stable v1.0.0 not released., public_release_status=RC3 remains latest public release; RC4 not yet tagged/published., startup_trust_pr=PR #186 merged at a2f2fba0de3288bdd69d377fa664d3aa1a0117dc; exact-head CI and independent ACCEPT passed; post-merge CI40084007415 and CodeQL40084007373 passed. PR #190 merged at 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169 after exact-head CI40084087463 all jobs SUCCESS, CodeQL40084087468 SUCCESS, JS/TS PASS, and independent ACCEPT exact diff ed9a108a. New main CodeQL40086738747 passed; main CI40086738643 Node22/24 full CLI suites running., user_intent=Startup chooser matching screenshot: ask Trust this folder before project instructions load; offer Trust and continue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Monitor PR194 exact-head CI. After merge, rebase the archive reproducibility fix and run exact-head checks only after safe SUITE handoff. Then rerun RC4 cross-runner comparison. Continue independent custody, provider, and terminal work., ci_watch=2026-10-24 11:27:53 UTC refresh: CI40086738643 on exact main 57b9285 passed test-matrix Node22 and Node24 and Linux `npm --prefix cli test`; Linux job is now running first `scripts/package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4` artifact build. CodeQL40086738747 passed. Earlier inferred failure was incorrect; no failing test is confirmed., terminal_matrix_prepared=ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable, Ubuntu 26.04 x86_64, Node22.22.1, required terminal apps present. Published RC4 installed to isolated prefix; version and MANIFEST verified. GNOME Terminal was launched in a disposable untrusted /tmp folder with packaged Nexus running; user confirmation of visible chooser pending. Human 15-cell matrix remains 0/15., release_status=RC4 published as candidate; v1.0.0 stable publication authorized but gated by acceptance., main_ci_latest=At 2026-10-24 14:02 UTC, exact origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1 CI40098339766: Node22 PASS, Node24 PASS, Linux npm --prefix cli test PASS (transitioned at 14:01:48Z to package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4). Linux packaging/repro/smoke/installer gates still active; wait for terminal., pr192_checks=All but linux-x86_64 packaging passed on head 03a8db1 / base b0240273. Linux job currently in cargo release build., pr192_ci=PR #192 exact head 5db89cdf on base 57b9285: CI40090626565 complete SUCCESS all jobs including Node22/24 and linux-x86_64 (completed 2026-10-24T12:15:41Z); CodeQL40090626550 SUCCESS; independent review comment ACCEPT exact head. Main CI40091991934 on b024027 is still in progress: Node22 and Node24 SUCCESS, linux-x86_64 packaging/tests active. Do not merge PR192 until current main run is terminal to avoid overlapping new full suite. Workflow pin PR candidate remains clean at 1fced30 with independent ACCEPT; wait, then rebase after integration and exact-main checks., rc4_publication=Public prerelease v1.0.0-rc.4; tag peels to 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow40090364770 SUCCESS 2026-10-24T11:54:37Z. Archive SHA256 07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806 matches GitHub and SHA256SUMS; SLSA attestation verified for release.yml and source tag. Extracted manifest PASS; binary reports 1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285). Installed published package to isolated prefix on ubuntu-desktop; installer record source/digest and installed manifest match. T