k Trust this folder before project instructions load; offer Trust and continue, Continue without trusting, Exit. Continuing untrusted does not alter permission mode., next_actions=Monitor PR194 exact-head CI. After merge, rebase the archive reproducibility fix and run exact-head checks only after safe SUITE handoff. Then rerun RC4 cross-runner comparison. Continue independent custody, provider, and terminal work., ci_watch=2026-10-24 11:27:53 UTC refresh: CI40086738643 on exact main 57b9285 passed test-matrix Node22 and Node24 and Linux `npm --prefix cli test`; Linux job is now running first `scripts/package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4` artifact build. CodeQL40086738747 passed. Earlier inferred failure was incorrect; no failing test is confirmed., terminal_matrix_prepared=ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable, Ubuntu 26.04 x86_64, Node22.22.1, required terminal apps present. Published RC4 installed to isolated prefix; version and MANIFEST verified. GNOME Terminal was launched in a disposable untrusted /tmp folder with packaged Nexus running; user confirmation of visible chooser pending. Human 15-cell matrix remains 0/15., release_status=RC4 published as candidate; v1.0.0 stable publication authorized but gated by acceptance., main_ci_latest=At 2026-10-24 14:02 UTC, exact origin/main be2cd2f255414f554572c86baa884d9271ff5ea1 CI40098339766: Node22 PASS, Node24 PASS, Linux npm --prefix cli test PASS (transitioned at 14:01:48Z to package-linux.sh v1.0.0-rc.4). Linux packaging/repro/smoke/installer gates still active; wait for terminal., pr192_checks=All but linux-x86_64 packaging passed on head 03a8db1 / base b0240273. Linux job currently in cargo release build., pr192_ci=PR #192 exact head 5db89cdf on base 57b9285: CI40090626565 complete SUCCESS all jobs including Node22/24 and linux-x86_64 (completed 2026-10-24T12:15:41Z); CodeQL40090626550 SUCCESS; independent review comment ACCEPT exact head. Main CI40091991934 on b024027 is still in progress: Node22 and Node24 SUCCESS, linux-x