e. Workflow pin PR candidate remains clean at 1fced30 with independent ACCEPT; wait, then rebase after integration and exact-main checks., rc4_publication=Public prerelease v1.0.0-rc.4; tag peels to 57b9285c6cead27b2260bf3113b3fc0b847f8169. Release workflow40090364770 SUCCESS 2026-10-24T11:54:37Z. Archive SHA256 07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806 matches GitHub and SHA256SUMS; SLSA attestation verified for release.yml and source tag. Extracted manifest PASS; binary reports 1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285). Installed published package to isolated prefix on ubuntu-desktop; installer record source/digest and installed manifest match. This is construction/install smoke only, not RC acceptance., rc4_cross_runner=Exact RC4 cross-runner workflow40092008160 passed tag resolution on current main b024027 and is building the tagged source57b9285 on Ubuntu22.04 and 24.04; comparisons pending., heldout_blocker=Fresh public issue #1 check at 2026-10-24T12:25Z shows no custodian response since 02:16:57Z; no author/custodian claim or acknowledged handoff, Agent Mail has zero active window identities. T2 legacy hidden.command remains incompatible with blackbox-v1 runner. No private payloads accessed and no qualification started. This is an external custodian dependency; existing metadata requests should not be spammed., pr183_handoff=PR183 owner RubyBridge asked at 2026-10-24T11:49:03Z to confirm active refresh or safe-boundary claim transfer; no reply yet. Claim remains protected., new_release_blocker=Main b0240273 cross-runner reproducibility workflow run 40092008160 failed at startup: .github/workflows/repro.yml pins actions/download-artifact to upload-artifact commit ea165f..., which GitHub cannot resolve. Verified actions/download-artifact v4 tag SHA d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093. Need separate claimed workflow fix after PR192 slice., pr192_review=GitHub comment by mikeholownych at 11:44:43Z: ACCEPT on exact PR diff, reports focused repl_approval_e2