BLOCKED\\\",\\\"number\\\":196,\\\"reviewDecision\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"reviews\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUBdyCg\\\",\\\"author\\\":{\\\"login\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\"},\\\"authorAssociation\\\":\\\"OWNER\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\\\n\\\\n- **Target Head**: `585a675fc616cea5d72c8166bf6b47bab3c46540`\\\\n- **Base Commit**: `72e769348fe8a978a576627a4802cb6b68ced779` (`origin/main`)\\\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `scripts/package-linux.sh` only.\\\\n\\\\n#### Findings & Verification\\\\n1. **Containerized Archive Generation**:\\\\n   - Encapsulates `tar` and `gzip` operations inside the pinned builder container (`NEXUS_BUILD_CONTAINER_IMAGE`) when running under containerized release builds, eliminating the host-level PAX device-number format variance between Ubuntu 22.04 and Ubuntu 24.04 toolchains identified in workflow run 40103980794.\\\\n   - Preserves user ownership mapping (`--user $(id -u):$(id -g)`), read-only source package mounts, and deterministic `SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` / `gzip -n` normalization.\\\\n   - Correctly canonicalizes `OUT` to a physical path (`pwd -P`) for container bind-mount reliability.\\\\n   - Retains the uncontainerized host fallback for local development.\\\\n2. **Static & Integrity Validation**:\\\\n   - `bash -n scripts/package-linux.sh`: **PASS** (syntax valid).\\\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`72e7693`): **CLEAN** (0 merge conflicts).\\\\n3. **Hosted CI**:\\\\n   - CodeQL Run [40104113200](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40104113200): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\\\n   - CI Run [40104113197](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40104113197): active in `test-matrix`.\\\\n\\\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\\\",\\\"submittedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-24T14:55:53Z\\\",\\\"includesCreatedEdit\\\":false,\\\"reactionGroups\\\":[],\\\"state\\\":\\\"COMMENTED\\\",\\\"commit\\\":{\\\"oid\\\":\\\"