lan05_readonly_review` at this exact head; net patch SHA-256 `a34a2211eef52d580c6e300b2ce88b7115b23e4cf60fb011b896af4cd009f20`\\n- Exact-head CI: CodeQL, JavaScript/TypeScript analysis, CodeRabbit, Node 22 and Node 24 passed. Linux x86_64 package/reproducibility/SBOM/smoke/installer job is in progress in run `40108251357`.\\n- Current main CI on the exact base (`40105438204`) and CodeQL (`40105438209`) passed.\\n- No local test suite was run because the repository's `SUITE` claim remains held by `KimiCode-defect-scan`.\\n\\nA fresh exact-head CI and a new cross-runner comparison against a newly built RC are required. RC4 remains immutable; this PR cannot retroactively change its failed reproduction result.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"da5f26925b4379187e1f96a8ccf924209b7ebb84\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T16:10:26Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":392699644}},"started_at_ms":1792858230317,"completed_at_ms":1792858230710}}
