{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T16:43:59.011Z","ordinal":297044,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16ec6-5068-7a43-a634-88dec514377c","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16ec6-5068-7a43-a634-88dec514377c","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adce04da3f881a0a686b8a2fe9907e3","usage":{"input_tokens":169589,"cached_input_tokens":168704,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":117,"reasoning_output_tokens":30,"total_tokens":169706},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5467066,"cached_input_tokens":5339008,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":31821,"reasoning_output_tokens":23210,"total_tokens":5498887},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5397205721,"cached_input_tokens":5339682048,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15007832,"reasoning_output_tokens":8553378,"total_tokens":5412213553}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T16:43:59.015Z","ordinal":297045,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16ecc-34a7-71d1-a3c3-7d052f49bfff","call_id":"call_77be2da1c4114a9190f79cb2cc501e01","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\\n- As a guard before registering agents or sending messages.\\n\\nHow it works\\n------------\\n- Validates that `human_key` is an absolute directory path (the agent's working directory).\\n- Computes a stable slug from `human_key` (lowercased, safe characters) so\\n  multiple agents can refer to the same project consistently.\\n- Ensures DB row exists and that the on-disk archive is initialized\\n  (e.g., `messages/`, `agents/`, `file_reservations/` directories).\\n\\nCRITICAL: Project Identity Rules\\n---------------------------------\\n- The `human_key` MUST be the absolute path t\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\\nlimit : int\\n    Maximum summaries to return (default 5).\\nformat : str, optional\\n    Output format.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary(args: { format?: string | null; limit?: number; project_key: string; since_hours?: number; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\\n```\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts }] }\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16ec6-5068-7a43-a634-88dec514377c","create_time":1792860239.015045}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
