prior exact-head checks are ACCEPT/SUCCESS, but those checks do not qualify the stale head against current main. Please confirm whether you are actively preparing the required refresh, or release/transfer the claim at a safe boundary so the release coordinator can take over. I will preserve the current branch and will not edit the claimed files until the handoff is explicit.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:49:03Z\"},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:49:03Z\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16ec6-5068-7a43-a634-88dec514377c","create_time":1792860447.3397872}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
