{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:03:15.609Z","ordinal":298086,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adce4d0cb3c81a0bba8b009e5c6a220","status":"completed","call_id":"call_30afa27b15b14c7da1a7ec022aa1b96b","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"BODY_FILE=$(mktemp)\\ncat > \\\"$BODY_FILE\\\" <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Preserve the existing automated commit behavior while excluding `.nexus` state from commits.\\n- Handle an initialized repository with no commits: verify that `HEAD` points to a missing symbolic branch, remove pre-staged `.nexus` entries from the index without changing workspace files, and fail closed for detached or malformed `HEAD` states.\\n- Add a regression proving the first ordinary file commits while pre-staged `.nexus` state remains on disk and out of the commit.\\n\\nThis is a current-main refresh of the valid implementation slice from PR #183. The original PR branch and worktree remain preserved; this PR does not merge the stale PR head.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_commit.test.ts`: 8/8 passed under isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT at exact patch SHA-256 `c6d90dee84810f10b637ed9d01c382fb792832540d324ed8af243c720f3fe85a` against base `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b`.\\n\\nExact-head CI is required before integration.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-nexus-commit-exclusion-refresh --title \\\"fix(git): preserve first-commit support when excluding .nexus\\\" --body-file \\\"$BODY_FILE\\\"\\npython3 -c 'import os,sys; os.unlink(sys.argv[1])' \\\"$BODY_FILE\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":2000});text(JSON.stringify(r));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16ed9-c60e-7103-9ada-b7f9a638664b","create_time":17928613