{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:18:00.845Z","ordinal":298690,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16eea-52ae-7e20-b7bc-6460b8b8bcfa","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-ecc6f866-bc1b-4604-81f9-a1ed591cd2b1","process_id":"75484","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n \"sync-version|npm version|version-only|release-version|tag_name\" .github/workflows scripts docs/releases docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md | head -120; rg -n '\"version\"' package.json cli/package.json | head"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'sync-version|npm version|version-only|release-version|tag_name' .github/workflows scripts docs/releases docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md","query":"sync-version|npm version|version-only|release-version|tag_name","path":"workflows"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n '\"version\"' package.json cli/package.json","query":"\"version\"","path":"package.json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:28:5. **Stable promotion and publication.** After exact-RC acceptance and G6 pass, create a stable-version commit directly on the accepted RC commit, changing only the synchronized version metadata required for v1.0.0. Record both commits and the version-only diff. Run required source CI and all applicable source G0–G4 checks on this exact stable-version commit before tagging. If any other source changes, restart RC construction and qualification. Then create the `v1.0.0` tag on that checked commit and build a draft release. Keep its assets unpublished while verifying the stable artifact identity, provenance, package contents, installation, and publication metadata. Compare the stable package contents with the accepted RC; if packaged behavior or content differs beyond version-specific metadata, rerun affected installed-RC qualification gates and obtain independent acceptance for the stable artifact. Publish the draft only after these checks pass and the signed acceptance disposition is recorded. Record the published digests and provenance.\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:30:The final G6 decision in §10 applies to promoting the accepted RC toward a stable release. It requires the applicable gates to pass for the accepted RC and authorizes the version-only stable commit and its source checks, followed by the stable tag and draft build; it does not waive source CI, artifact identity, installed-RC qualification, or any threshold. Public publication is a separate post-build gate in stage 5 above. The release workflow must keep stable assets in draft state until stable artifact checks pass. Source verification at integration 6a16cb6 confirms the tag-triggered release workflow now supports published RC prereleases and draft stable releases. The earlier immediate-stable-publication source blocker is resolved; an actual stable draft build, artifact verification, signed acceptance, and deliberate publication are still required and remain unproven until their run evidence is recorded.\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:327:G6 passes only when every item below holds. It authorizes a version-only stable commit from the accepted RC source, followed by its source checks, stable tag, and unpublished draft candidate; it does not authorize making stable assets publicly available. RC tags are candidate construction inputs governed by §1.1; an RC tag or its successful build does not satisfy this release decision.\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:59:      - id: release-version\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:61:      - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:62:      - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:63:      - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:65:      - run: bash scripts/smoke-package.sh \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:66:      - run: bash scripts/installer-smoke.sh \"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/install.sh\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\"\ncli/package.json:3:  \"version\": \"0.1.0-alpha.2\",\npackage.json:3:  \"version\": \"0.1.0-alpha.2\",\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":28443}},"started_at_ms":1792862280844,"completed_at_ms":1792862280845}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:18:01.896Z","ordinal":298691,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16eeb-60a8-7bf1-b085-9ba77edf3cdc","call_id":"call_f64a8c337ee64a069194f3ca4a43bf6d","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:28:5. **Stable promotion and publication.** After exact-RC acceptance and G6 pass, create a stable-version commit directly on the accepted RC commit, changing only the synchronized version metadata required for v1.0.0. Record both commits and the version-only diff. Run required source CI and all applicable source G0–G4 checks on this exact stable-version commit before tagging. If any other source changes, restart RC construction and qualification. Then create the `v1.0.0` tag on that checked commit and build a draft release. Keep its assets unpublished while verifying the stable artifact identity, provenance, package contents, installation, and publication metadata. Compare the stable package contents with the accepted RC; if packaged behavior or content differs beyond version-specific metadata, rerun affected installed-RC qualification gates and obtain independent acceptance for the stable artifact. Publish the draft only after these checks pass and the signed acceptance disposition is recorded. Record the published digests and provenance.\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:30:The final G6 decision in §10 applies to promoting the accepted RC toward a stable release. It requires the applicable gates to pass for the accepted RC and authorizes the version-only stable commit and its source checks, followed by the stable tag and draft build; it does not waive source CI, artifact identity, installed-RC qualification, or any threshold. Public publication is a separate post-build gate in stage 5 above. The release workflow must keep stable assets in draft state until stable artifact checks pass. Source verification at integration 6a16cb6 confirms the tag-triggered release workflow now supports published RC prereleases and draft stable releases. The earlier immediate-stable-publication source blocker is resolved; an actual stable draft build, artifact verification, signed acceptance, and deliberate publication are still required and remain unproven until their run evidence is recorded.\ndocs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:327:G6 passes only when every item below holds. It authorizes a version-only stable commit from the accepted RC source, followed by its source checks, stable tag, and unpublished draft candidate; it does not authorize making stable assets publicly available. RC tags are candidate construction inputs governed by §1.1; an RC tag or its successful build does not satisfy this release decision.\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:59:      - id: release-version\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:61:      - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:62:      - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:63:      - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:65:      - run: bash scripts/smoke-package.sh \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\"\n.github/workflows/ci.yml:66:      - run: bash scripts/installer-smoke.sh \"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/install.sh\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\"\ncli/package.json:3:  \"version\": \"0.1.0-alpha.2\",\npackage.json:3:  \"version\": \"0.1.0-alpha.2\",\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16eea-52ae-7e20-b7bc-6460b8b8bcfa","create_time":1792862281.8965056}},"metad