ir Markdown notes into claude-mem. Never assume a hosted memory search was intercepted: search claude-mem directly when its result is needed.\n\nFull hook output saved to: /tmp/hook_outputs/01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92/ec103a87-a97b-4bc3-a785-2b55ce122731.txt"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16eee-fedb-7732-9ae7-8cbb47107b53","create_time":1792863014.5817285,"content_item_kinds":["hooks.additional_context"]}}}
