{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:33:28.539Z","ordinal":299265,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16ef8-1479-7bc1-b23e-862a144e9535","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcebe7d68081a0a0cd65dd21a747be","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The reviewer’s retry concern is real: I added a regression assertion, and it fails because retries append another `.nexus/` rule. I’m fixing the retry path so it still adds a rule after a later same-file negation, but stops appending when Git continues to reject an already-added positive rule."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792863207872,"completed_at_ms":1792863208539}}
