{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:34:08.769Z","ordinal":299306,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16ef8-1479-7bc1-b23e-862a144e9535","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c2d3948a-1f00-4d45-8f46-374431b19c79","process_id":"87461","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 198 --json headRefName,headRefOid,body,assignees,reviewRequests,url\n gh pr diff 198 --name-only\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- git exclusion claims'; find \"$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims\" -maxdepth 1 -iname '*git_exclude*' -print -exec sh -c 'for x do [ -f \"$x/owner.json\" ] && cat \"$x/owner.json\"; done' sh {} +\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- relevant active claim owner files'; find \"$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims\" -maxdepth 2 -name owner.json -print | xargs -r rg -l 'git_exclude|8177a3b|PR #198|PR198'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 198 --json headRefName,headRefOid,body,assignees,reviewRequests,url\n gh pr diff 198 --name-only\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- git exclusion claims'; find \"$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims\" -maxdepth 1 -iname '*git_exclude*' -print -exec sh -c 'for x do [ -f \"$x/owner.json\" ] && cat \"$x/owner.json\"; done' sh {} +\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- relevant active claim owner files'; find \"$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims\" -maxdepth 2 -name owner.json -print | xargs -r rg -l 'git_exclude|8177a3b|PR #198|PR198'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"assignees\":[],\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Preserve the existing automated commit behavior while excluding `.nexus` state from commits.\\n- Handle an initialized repository with no commits: verify that `HEAD` points to a missing symbolic branch, remove pre-staged `.nexus` entries from the index without changing workspace files, and fail closed for detached or malformed `HEAD` states.\\n- Add a regression proving the first ordinary file commits while pre-staged `.nexus` state remains on disk and out of the commit.\\n\\nThis is a current-main refresh of the valid implementation slice from PR #183. The original PR branch and worktree remain preserved; this PR does not merge the stale PR head.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_commit.test.ts`: 8/8 passed under isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT at exact patch SHA-256 `c6d90dee84810f10b637ed9d01c382fb792832540d324ed8af243c720f3fe85a` against base `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b`.\\n\\nExact-head CI is required before integration.\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/defect-nexus-commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"headRefOid\":\"8177a3b8a3cb016bd7246f9fa79ae074131b612a\",\"reviewRequests\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/198\"}\ncli/src/git.ts\ncli/test/git_commit.test.ts\n--- git exclusion claims\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_test_git_exclude.test.ts\n.git/nexus-claims/DEFECT_GIT_EXCLUDE_FAIL_CLOSED_20261024\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_src_core_git_exclude.ts\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T05:16:38Z\",\n  \"pid\": 1999482,\n  \"scope\": \"hot regression test file for Git ignore fail-closed remediation\",\n  \"status\": \"rebased exact main; unchanged reviewed diff sha256 0b475a5f; focused tests 8/8; diff-check PASS; independent review refresh pending\",\n  \"head\": \"3d5fd0912d91839de6e6c0fb528046ad1b09afff\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-24T17:28:59Z\",\n  \"independent_review\": \"ACCEPT\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"rc1_docs_review\",\n  \"reviewed_diff_sha256\": \"0b475a5f307e718759ffa579a2322337fcab026d08997862ded76ea8381d901c\",\n  \"review_note\": \"Review found and corrected fixed-sentinel bypass; final diff checks .nexus/ directory itself and tests higher-priority negation plus old sentinel-specific ignore. Commit content matches accepted final diff.\"\n}\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T05:16:38Z\",\n  \"pid\": 1999482,\n  \"scope\": \"fix effective Git ignore verification for .nexus; regress leading-space rule and later-negation bypass\",\n  \"status\": \"rebased exact main; unchanged reviewed diff sha256 0b475a5f; focused tests 8/8; diff-check PASS; independent review refresh pending\",\n  \"head\": \"3d5fd0912d91839de6e6c0fb528046ad1b09afff\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-24T17:28:59Z\",\n  \"independent_review\": \"ACCEPT\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"rc1_docs_review\",\n  \"reviewed_diff_sha256\": \"0b475a5f307e718759ffa579a2322337fcab026d08997862ded76ea8381d901c\",\n  \"review_note\": \"Review found and corrected fixed-sentinel bypass; final diff checks .nexus/ directory itself and tests higher-priority negation plus old sentinel-specific ignore. Commit content matches accepted final diff.\"\n}\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed\",\n  \"base\": \"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T05:16:38Z\",\n  \"pid\": 1999482,\n  \"scope\": \"hot file for Git ignore fail-closed remediation\",\n  \"status\": \"rebased exact main; unchanged reviewed diff sha256 0b475a5f; focused tests 8/8; diff-check PASS; independent review refresh pending\",\n  \"head\": \"3d5fd0912d91839de6e6c0fb528046ad1b09afff\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-24T17:28:59Z\",\n  \"independent_review\": \"ACCEPT\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"rc1_docs_review