{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:34:09.972Z","ordinal":299311,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a16efa-2634-7ab3-a5f3-7670d6095f94","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** for the uncommitted diff at `3d5fd0912d91839de6e6c0fb528046ad1b09afff`, SHA-256 `9518852b8ad6f9c2242a8b08f7b661925beed1d492f72847a75216dae17ec8f1`.\n\nThe retry guard prevents repeated appends when a higher-priority `.gitignore` conflict makes the check fail. A later negation within `info/exclude` still permits appending a final positive rule; the regression verifies that retries under the higher-priority conflict leave the file unchanged. No remaining blocker found. `git diff --check` is clean; I did not run tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16ef8-1479-7bc1-b23e-862a144e9535","create_time":1792863249.972226}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15292}}
