{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:35:25.879Z","ordinal":299367,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcec5b6fc481a0b3747f0a12ad629c","status":"completed","call_id":"call_dcdba8d2b5dd474cbc48bcb23783d620","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-pr-git-exclude-body.md <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\\n- Add a regression that retries the ineffective rule and verifies the exclude file no longer grows.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `npx tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts`: 8/8 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `9518852b8ad6f9c2242a8b08f7b661925beed1d492f72847a75216dae17ec8f1`.\\n- Exact-head CI is required before integration.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n- `main` at `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b`.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed --title \\\"fix(git): avoid duplicate ineffective exclusion rules\\\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr-git-exclude-body.md\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,\"max_output_tokens\":2000}); text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16ef8-1479-7bc1-b23e-862a144e9535","create_time":1792863323.4402041}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:35:26.004Z","ordinal":299368,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16ef8-1479-7bc1-b23e-862a144e9535","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16ef8-1479-7bc1-b23e-862a144e9535","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adcec5a53f881a0960fdf60cb099d3f","usage":{"input_tokens":129206,"cached_input_tokens":129024,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":448,"reasoning_output_tokens":63,"total_tokens":129654},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":2455002,"cached_input_tokens":2410496,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":13744,"reasoning_output_tokens":9295,"total_tokens":2468746},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5438406835,"cached_input_tokens":5380338304,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15180093,"reasoning_output_tokens":8665577,"total_tokens":5453586928}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:35:30.751Z","ordinal":299369,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16ef8-1479-7bc1-b23e-862a144e9535","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-290bd210-e4ce-4986-8a0f-3a4661cc1a77","process_id":"33735","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat > /tmp/nexus-pr-git-exclude-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\n- Add a regression that retries the ineffective rule and verifies the exclude file no longer grows.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npx tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts`: 8/8 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `9518852b8ad6f9c2242a8b08f7b661925beed1d492f72847a75216dae17ec8f1`.\n- Exact-head CI is required before integration.\n\n## Base\n\n- `main` at `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b`.\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed --title \"fix(git): avoid duplicate ineffective exclusion rules\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr-git-exclude-body.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat > /tmp/nexus-pr-git-exclude-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\n- Add a regression that retries the ineffective rule and verifies the exclude file no longer grows.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npx tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts`: 8/8 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `9518852b8ad6f9c2242a8b08f7b661925beed1d492f72847a75216dae17ec8f1`.\n- Exact-head CI is required before integration.\n\n## Base\n\n- `main` at `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b`.\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed --title \"fix(git): avoid duplicate ineffective exclusion rules\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr-git-exclude-body.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/200\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":527680162}},"started_at_ms":1792863327223,"completed_at_ms":1792863330751}}
