| Kill only PIDs you started, taken from `$!` or `ps -eo pid,args \\| grep -v grep`. **Never `pkill -f` or `killall`.** Long background jobs are stopped through the agent's own task controls. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-06-packaged-product-parity.md:37:| 7 | Installer: strict tag regex; `-fsSL --show-error`; no-stable-release hint naming the latest prerelease; rate-limit message; `MANIFEST.sha256` repair on reinstall; `NEXUS_FORCE=1`. | `install.sh:21-49`; `package-linux.sh` (write manifest) | — |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:26:- `cli/src/slash/workspace_commands.ts`\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:29:- `eval/run.mjs`\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:40:| 3 | Replace `onConfirm && isMutating` with the policy. If no handler is available and a decision is required, return DENIED with reason `DECISION_REQUIRED_NO_OPERATOR`. Egress per-origin memory lives on the agent and is cleared on `/mode` change and on resume. | `agent.ts:3945-3975`; subagent dispatch `agent.ts:5384` | 2 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:42:| 5 | Route verifier executions through the policy as `exec`. When not trusted and no prior approval exists, emit the approval with `kind: \"verifier\"`, the command, and the resolved script body (read `package.json` `scripts.test`, the Makefile `test:` recipe, `Cargo.toml`/`pytest.ini` presence). Cache the approval per (workspace, command, script digest) for the session. | `agent.ts:1602-1630,3432-3436,4034`; `tester.ts:113-136` (add `describeVerifier()`); `approval_review.ts` (new kind) | 3 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:43:| 6 | `/test` and `nexus eval` use the bridge runner instead of `execSync`. | `tester.ts:143-163`; `repl.ts:1357`; `slash/workspace_commands.ts:160`; `evaluator.ts` | 5 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-01-safe-execution-defaults.md:45:| 8 | Update the eval runner to pass `--yes`. Do **not** edit `demo/` while contest judging is open (D