e-return spoofing in HTML decoded text and search URL fields; refresh PR #175 to current main; add regressions and obtain independent review; no held-out access\\\"}\\n{\\\"agent\\\":\\\"codex-root\\\",\\\"branch\\\":\\\"v1/defect-mcp-proto-name\\\",\\\"since\\\":\\\"2026-10-24T13:35:33Z\\\",\\\"pid\\\":3424031}\\n{\\\"agent\\\":\\\"/root\\\",\\\"host\\\":\\\"mike-dev\\\",\\\"branch\\\":\\\"v1/defect-nexus-commit-exclusion-refresh\\\",\\\"worktree\\\":\\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/commit-exclusion-refresh\\\",\\\"base\\\":\\\"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\\\",\\\"since\\\":\\\"2026-10-24T16:55:08Z\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"Refresh PR183 .nexus commit exclusion defense and tests on current main; preserve original owner branch/worktree; no edits to git_exclude.ts or qualification data.\\\"}\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"Antigravity\\\",\\n  \\\"branch\\\": \\\"v1/docs-post-v1-roadmap\\\",\\n  \\\"worktree\\\": \\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-post-v1\\\",\\n  \\\"since\\\": \\\"2026-10-21T16:33:56Z\\\",\\n  \\\"scope\\\": \\\"add Dependabot PRs triage and work packages to v1.1.0 roadmap and documentation\\\"\\n}\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"Codex memory roadmap review\\\",\\n  \\\"branch\\\": \\\"v1/docs-v11-layered-memory\\\",\\n  \\\"worktree\\\": \\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v11-layered-memory-roadmap\\\",\\n  \\\"since\\\": \\\"2026-10-22T21:14:20.166350+00:00\\\",\\n  \\\"scope\\\": \\\"User-authorized additive WP-1109 memory roadmap and README links in isolated worktree; preserve existing dependency planning on docs-post-v1 branch; no product code or v1.0 acceptance changes\\\",\\n  \\\"head\\\": \\\"fbee269aa46912fae31ed1a202fc47790ef19cf0\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"Documentation checks passed; local commit prepared for owner integration into existing docs-post-v1 roadmap branch; no push or merge; file claims released\\\"\\n}\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"codex-root\\\",\\n  \\\"branch\\\": \\\"v1/plan-09-pr-9b-m6-sequence\\\",\\n  \\\"worktree\\\": \\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/p