h/nexus-code/actions/runs/40114372030/job/120932509088\t\n{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Preserve the existing automated commit behavior while excluding `.nexus` state from commits.\\n- Handle an initialized repository with no commits: verify that `HEAD` points to a missing symbolic branch, remove pre-staged `.nexus` entries from the index without changing workspace files, and fail closed for detached or malformed `HEAD` states.\\n- Add a regression proving the first ordinary file commits while pre-staged `.nexus` state remains on disk and out of the commit.\\n\\nThis is a current-main refresh of the valid implementation slice from PR #183. The original PR branch and worktree remain preserved; this PR does not merge the stale PR head.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_commit.test.ts`: 8/8 passed under isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT at exact patch SHA-256 `c6d90dee84810f10b637ed9d01c382fb792832540d324ed8af243c720f3fe85a` against base `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b`.\\n\\nExact-head CI is required before integration.\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfLKbFg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"coderabbitai\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"e9bb8d72-00e8-4f67-9cb2-caf3b22574fe\\\"} --> 🔍 Trigger review\\n> \\n> This repository does not receive automatic reviews because it has fewer than 10 stars.\\n> \\n> <details>\\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" align=\\\"absmiddle\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\\n> <dl>\\n> <dd>\\n> \\n> - **Source mode**: Auto\\n> - **Repository**: Unavailable\\n> - **Branch**: Unavailable\\n> - **File**: No configuration file from this repository applied\\n> - **Commit**: Unavailable\\n> - **Layers**: defaults\\n> - **Review profile**: CHILL\\n> - **Plan**: Advanced\\n> - **Run ID**: `64388d98-004a-412a-bcd8-42b71d7fd3d7`\\n> \\n> </dd>\\n> </dl>\\n> </details>\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n<!-- autopilot:start -->\\n- [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"2708ad07-9f24-4260-9c11-7dc76a49f2e3\\\"} --> <strong title=\\\"Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\\">Autofix</strong> · Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\n<!-- autopilot:end -->\\n<!-- tips_start -->\\n\\n\\n\\nThanks for using [CodeRabbit](https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=oss&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=mikeholownych/nexus-code&utm_content=198)! It's free for OSS, and your support helps us grow. If you like it, consider giving us a shout-out.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary><strong>❤️ Share</strong></summary>\\n<dl>\\n<dd>\\n\\n- [X](https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A&url=https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [Mastodon](https://mastodon.social/share?text=I%20just%20used%20%40coderabbitai%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20the%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai)\\n- [Reddit](https://www.reddit.com/submit?title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&text=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code.%20Check%20it%20out%3A%20https%3A//coderabbit.ai)\\n- [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoderabbit.ai&mini=true&title=Great%20tool%20for%20code%20review%20-%20CodeRabbit&summary=I%20just%20used%20CodeRabbit%20for%20my%20code%20review%2C%20and%20it%27s%20fantastic%21%20It%27s%20free%20for%20OSS%20and%20offers%20a%20free%20trial%20for%20proprietary%20code)\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n<sub>Comment `@coderabbitai help` to get the list of available commands.</sub>\\n\\n<!-- tips_end -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:03:27Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/198#issuecomment-6387047190\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfLW7yw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"**Independent review (claude-code) at exact head `8177a3b8a3cb016bd7246f9fa79ae074131b612a` (base `41b381dd`): ACCEPT.**\\n\\nThis is the same slice I accepted on #183, refreshed onto current main. I verified it in a scratch repo:\\n- `git show-ref --verify --quiet refs/heads/<branch>` exits 1 for an unborn branch, so the unborn path is taken only for a genuine symbolic, unborn HEAD. Detached or broken HEAD fails closed.\\n- Exclude-only pathspecs `:(top,exclude).nexus` + `:(top,exclude).nexus/**` still stage the whole tree when the workspace is a subdirectory of the repository. `top.txt` and `sub/s.txt` were staged and `.nexus/` stayed untracked, so this keeps the old `git add -A` scope.\\n- `git rm --cached -r -f --ignore-unmatch` and `git reset HEAD -- :(top).nexus` change only the index, not the workspace.\\n- Clearing `GIT_*_PATHSPECS` stops an environment-level literal or glob mode from defeating the magic pathspecs.\\n\\nThis is post-rc.4, so it falls in rc.5 scope.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:22:51Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/198#issuecomment-6387252171\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfLj2lw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Exact-Head CI Qualification: Green\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `8177a3b8a3cb016bd7246f9fa79ae074131b612a`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **CodeQL**: Run [40114372042](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40114372042) `✓ SUCCESS`\\n- **CI**: Run [40114372030](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40114372030) `✓ SUCCESS` (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, `linux-x86_64` reproducible packaging, CycloneDX SBOM validation, smoke tests)\\n- **Review**: ACCEPT ([Review](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/198#pullrequestreview-5638994012))\\n\\nSlice is fully verified and qualified for landing by repository owner.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:43:17Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/198#issuecomment-6387463831\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-24T17:02:49Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-24T17:02:49Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(git): support internal-state exclusion before first commit\",\"oid\":\"8177a3b8a3cb016bd7246f9fa79ae074131b612a\"}],\"mergeCommit\":{\"oid\":\"676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef\"},\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUB2Luw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `8177a3b8a3cb016bd7246f9fa79ae074131b612a`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/git.ts` and `cli/test/git_commit.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Unborn & Initialized Repository First-Commit Support**:\\n   - `commitChanges` verifies whether `HEAD` resolves (`git rev-parse --verify --quiet HEAD`). If a HEAD commit exists, it un-stages pre-staged `.nexus` index entries with `git reset --quiet HEAD -- :(top).nexus`.\\n   - If `HEAD` is unborn (as in a newly initialized repository before the first commit), it confirms `HEAD` is a symbolic ref pointing to an unborn branch (`git symbolic-ref -q HEAD` and `git show-ref --verify --quiet` returning exit code 1), failing closed on detached/malformed HEAD.\\n   - For an unborn branch, it clears pre-staged `.nexus` entries using `git rm --cached -r -f --ignore-unmatch -- :(top).nexus`, ensuring workspace files remain intact while stripping them from the initial commit tree.\\n   - Environmental sanitization deletes `GIT_LITERAL_PATHSPECS`, `GIT_GLOB_PATHSPECS`, `GIT_NOGLOB_PATHSPECS`, `GIT_ICASE_PATHSPECS` from `gitEnv`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated ephemeral worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/git_commit.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (1.42s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`41b381d`): **CLEAN** (`45fbc2a5c1e678c9c3aa51ff6ee2d27ef0b674fe`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40114372042](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40114372042): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40114372030](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40114372030): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:06:18Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"8177a3b8a3cb016bd7246f9fa79ae074131b612a\"}}]}\n.git/nexus-claims/DEFECT_NEXUS_COMMIT_EXCLUSION_20261024/owner.json\n{\"agent\":\"/root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-nexus-commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"base\":\"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\"since\":\"2026-10-24T16:55:08Z\",\"scope\":\"Refresh PR183 .nexus commit exclusion defense and tests on current main; preserve original owner branch/worktree; no edits to git_exclude.ts or qualification data.\"}\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_src_git.ts/owner.json\n{\"agent\":\"/root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-nexus-commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"base\":\"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\"since\":\"2026-10-24T16:55:08Z\",\"scope\":\"Refresh PR183 commitChanges staging boundary on current main; original owner worktree preserved.\"}\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_cli_test_git_commit.test.ts/owner.json\n{\"agent\":\"/root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-nexus-commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/commit-exclusion-refresh\",\"base\":\"41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b\",\"since\":\"2026-10-24T16:55:08Z\",\"scope\":\"Refresh PR183 staging exclusion regression tests on current main; original owner worktree preserved.\"}\n","exit_code":1,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":599098324}},"started_at_ms":1792863938670,"completed_at_ms":1792863940270}}
