{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:52:45.692Z","ordinal":300080,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f03-b5c2-7ab2-ba06-07db849a401d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcf06cab6081a0bc47cefa25ef1561","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The PR #200 failure is a real regression, not a runner issue: the new code returns early when a parent `.nexus/` rule already ignores children, so it never writes the explicit `.nexus/worktrees/` and `.nexus/flights/` entries that an existing integration test requires. I’m correcting that in the already-claimed worktree and will run only the affected tests."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792864364719,"completed_at_ms":1792864365692}}
