{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:53:06.587Z","ordinal":300105,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f03-b5c2-7ab2-ba06-07db849a401d","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16f03-b5c2-7ab2-ba06-07db849a401d","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adcf07cd95c81a08d085ba4960bff13","usage":{"input_tokens":186549,"cached_input_tokens":184832,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":624,"reasoning_output_tokens":573,"total_tokens":187173},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":7190765,"cached_input_tokens":7094656,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":23477,"reasoning_output_tokens":15832,"total_tokens":7214242},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5451977636,"cached_input_tokens":5393686656,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15227329,"reasoning_output_tokens":8696945,"total_tokens":5467204965}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:53:06.590Z","ordinal":300106,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16f0b-7e1e-7040-997e-5029932821eb","call_id":"call_4b8ea1b09e5740e6957c399b031c385a","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nAcknowledge a message addressed to an agent (and mark as read).\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Sets both read_ts and ack_ts for the (agent, message) pairing\\n- Safe to call multiple times; subsequent calls will return the prior timestamps\\n\\nIdempotency\\n-----------\\n- If acknowledgement already exists, the previous timestamps are preserved and returned.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- Respond to messages with `ack_required=true` to signal exp\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSoft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active project lists. All messages are preserved and the project can be restored with unarchive_project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project(args: { project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate a new, unique agent identity and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nHow this differs from `register_agent`\\n--------------------------------------\\n- Always creates a new identity with a fresh unique name (never updates an existing one).\\n- `name_hint`, if provided, MUST be a valid adjective+noun combination and must be available,\\n  otherwise an error is raised. Without a hint, a random adjective+noun name is generated.\\n\\nCRIT\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer send or receive new messages.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]:\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\\n- As a guard before registering agents or sending messages.\\n\\nHow it works\\n------------\\n- Validates that `human_key` is an absolute directory path (the agent's working directory).\\n- Computes a stable slug from `human_key` (lowercased, safe characters) so\\n  multiple \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMark a window identity as expired.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to expire.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { window_uuid, expired: bool, expired_at }\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; window_uuid: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [k\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\\n\\nFilters\\n-------\\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 timestamp string; messages strictly newer than this are returned\\n- `limit`: max number of messages (default 20)\\n- `include_bodies`: include full Markdown bodies in the payloads\\n- `topic`: filter to messages with this topic tag\\n\\nUsage patterns\\n--------\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\\nlimit : int\\n    Maximum summaries to return (default 5).\\nformat : str, optional\\n    Output format.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary(args: { format?: string | null; limit?: numb\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nFetch all messages in a project with a given topic tag, regardless of recipient.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\ntopic_name : str\\n    The topic tag to filter by (case-insensitive).\\nlimit : int\\n    Max number of messages to return (default 50).\\ninclude_bodies : bool\\n    Include full Markdown bodies in the payloads (default true).\\nsince_ts : Optional[str]\\n    ISO-8601 timestamp; only messages \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest advisory file reservations (leases) on project-relative paths/globs.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- Conflicts are reported if an overlapping active exclusive reservation exists held by another agent\\n- Glob matching is symmetric (`fnmatchcase(a,b)` or `fnmatchcase(b,a)`), including exact matches\\n- When granted, a JSON artifact is written under `file_reservations/<sha1(path)>.json` and the DB is updated\\n- TTL must be >= 60 se\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservation\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nForce-release a stale file reservation held by another agent after inactivity heuristics.\\n\\nThe tool validates that the reservation appears abandoned (agent inactive beyond threshold and\\nno recent mail/filesystem/git activity). When released, an optional notification is sent to the\\nprevious holder summarizing the heuristics.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservat\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIRREVERSIBLY delete an agent and ALL associated data: messages sent by the agent, message recipient records, file reservations, agent links, window identities, and on-disk archive files (inbox, outbox, attachments). This is NOT soft-delete — data is permanently destroyed and cannot be recovered. Requires the confirmation parameter to be exactly 'I UNDERSTAND'.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_ag\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIRREVERSIBLY delete a project and ALL associated data: every agent, message, message recipient, file reservation, agent link, window identity, message summary, sibling suggestion, product link, and the entire on-disk project archive directory. This is NOT soft-delete — data is permanently destroyed and cannot be recovered. Requires the confirmation parameter to be exactly 'I UNDERSTAND'.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclar\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReturn basic readiness information for the Agent Mail server.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check(args: { format?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\n\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard(args: { code_repo_path: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts }] }\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identitie\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake(args: { agent_name?: string | null; auto_accept?: boolean; format?: string | null; model?: string | null; program?: string | null; project_key: string; reason?: string; register_if_missing?: boolean; requester?: string | null; requester_registr\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReserve a set of file paths and optionally release them at the end of the workflow.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_file_reservation_cycle(args: { agent_name: string; auto_release?: boolean; exclusive?: boolean; format?: string | null; paths: Array<string>; project_key: string; reason?: string; registration_token?: string | null; ttl_seconds?: number; }): Promise<CallToolResul\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMacro helper that aligns an agent with an existing thread by ensuring registration,\\nsummarising the thread, and fetching recent inbox context.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_prepare_thread(args: { agent_name?: string | null; format?: string | null; inbox_limit?: number; include_examples?: boolean; include_inbox_bodies?: boolean; llm_mode?: boolean; llm_model?: string | null; \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMacro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session(args: { agent_name?: string | null; file_reservation_paths?: Array<string> | null; file_reservation_reason?: string; file_reservation_ttl_seconds?: number; format?: string | null; human_\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__mark_message_read\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMark a specific message as read for the given agent.\\n\\nNotes\\n-----\\n- Read receipts are per-recipient; this only affects the specified agent.\\n- This does not send an acknowledgement; use `acknowledge_message` for that.\\n- Safe to call multiple times; later calls return the original timestamp.\\n\\nIdempotency\\n-----------\\n- If `mark_message_read` has already been called earlier for the same (agent, message),\\n  the original timestam\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nDelete messages older than the configured retention period. Defaults to retention_max_age_days from config (180 days). Returns count of messages purged.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages(args: { dry_run?: boolean; max_age_days?: number | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nWhen to use\\n-----------\\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\\n- To update an existing agent's program/model/task metadata and bump last_active.\\n\\nSemantics\\n---------\\n- If `name` is omitted, a random adjective+noun name is auto-generated.\\n- Reusing the same `name` updates the profile (program/model/task) and\\n  refreshes `\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__release_file_reservations\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRelease active file reservations held by an agent.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- If both `paths` and `file_reservation_ids` are omitted, all active reservations for the agent are released\\n- Otherwise, restricts release to matching ids and/or path patterns\\n- JSON artifacts stay in Git for audit; DB records get `released_ts`\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { released: int, released_at: iso8601 }\\n\\nIdempotency\\n-----------\\n- Safe to call repea\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nUpdate the display name of a window identity.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nwindow_uuid : str\\n    The UUID of the window identity to rename.\\nnew_display_name : str\\n    New display name (must be a valid adjective+noun agent name).\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    Updated window identity record.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__rename_window(args: { format?:\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__renew_file_reservations\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nExtend expiry for active file reservations held by an agent without reissuing them.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name : str\\n    Agent identity who owns the reservations.\\nextend_seconds : int\\n    Seconds to extend from the later of now or current expiry (min 60s).\\npaths : Optional[list[str]]\\n    Restrict renewals to matching path patterns.\\nfile_reservation_ids : Optional[list[\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__reply_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReply to an existing message, preserving or establishing a thread.\\n\\nBehavior\\n--------\\n- Inherits original `importance` and `ack_required` flags\\n- `thread_id` is taken from the original message if present; otherwise, the original id is used\\n- Subject is prefixed with `subject_prefix` if not already present\\n- Defaults `to` to the original sender if not explicitly provided\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project i\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRequest contact approval to message another agent.\\n\\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nfrom_agent : str\\n    Your agent name (must be registered in \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nApprove or deny a contact request.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact(args: { accept: boolean; format?: string | null; from_agent: string; from_project?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; to_agent: string; ttl_seconds?: number; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSoft-delete an agent: mark it as retired so it stops accepting new messages while preserving message history. Retired agents are hidden from active agent lists but visible in 'all agents' views.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__retire_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nFull-text search over subject and body for a project.\\n\\nTips\\n----\\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\\\"build plan\\\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\\n- Results are ordered by bm25 score (best matches first)\\n- Limit defaults to 20; raise for broad queries\\n\\nQuery examples\\n---------------\\n- Phrase search: `\\\"build plan\\\"`\\n- Prefix: `migrat*`\\n- Boolean: `plan AND users`\\n- Require urgent: `urgent AND deployment`\\n\\nParame\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nWhat this does\\n--------------\\n- Stores message (and recipients) in the database; updates sender's activity\\n- Writes a canonical `.md` under `messages/YYYY/MM/\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSet contact policy for an agent: open | auto | contacts_only | block_all.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; policy: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_recent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSummarize all recent project messages within a time window.\\n\\nFetches messages from the last ``since_hours`` hours, groups them by\\nthread, and produces a combined project-wide summary.  Results are\\nstored in the ``message_summaries`` table for fast retrieval via\\n``fetch_summary``.\\n\\nIdempotent: if a summary already exists for the same time window\\n(within 5-minute tolerance) it is returned from cache.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\npr\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__summarize_thread\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nExtract participants, key points, and action items for one or more threads.\\n\\nSingle-thread mode (thread_id is a single ID):\\n- Returns detailed summary with optional example messages\\n- Response: { thread_id, summary: {participants[], key_points[], action_items[]}, examples[] }\\n\\nMulti-thread mode (thread_id is comma-separated IDs like \\\"TKT-1,TKT-2,TKT-3\\\"):\\n- Returns aggregate digest across all threads\\n- Response: { threads: [\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRestore an archived project back to active status.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project(args: { project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\n\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__uninstall_precommit_guard(args: { code_repo_path: string; format?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRestore a retired agent back to active status. The agent will resume accepting new messages.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unretire_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nReturn enriched profile details for an agent, optionally including recent archive commits.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project slug or human key.\\nagent_name : str\\n    Agent name to look up (use resource://agents/{project_key} to discover names).\\ninclude_re\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f03-b5c2-7ab2-ba06-07db849a401d","create_time":1792864386.5903924}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
