{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:54:57.739Z","ordinal":300172,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a16f03-b5c2-7ab2-ba06-07db849a401d","turn_id":"01a16f03-b5c2-7ab2-ba06-07db849a401d","last_agent_message":"Understood—that screenshot shows a **project trust prompt** before Nexus loads project instructions. Nexus already has that flow in the RC4 source: it offers **Trust and continue**, **Continue without trusting**, and **Exit**. The RC4 tag includes it.\n\nThe `nexus` command on this machine resolves to **RC3**, which predates the prompt. So you wouldn’t see it when launching that installed version. I haven’t changed or installed anything.","started_at":1792863876,"completed_at":1792864497,"duration_ms":621184,"time_to_first_token_ms":3774}}
