{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:55:11.438Z","ordinal":300196,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcf0fee45081a08bd841b2269f6e14","status":"completed","call_id":"call_7bc05165e6164c87b7d790fd4f7dce44","name":"exec","input":"const names=[\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session\"];\nfor(const n of names){const t=ALL_TOOLS.find(x=>x.name===n); if(t) text(t.description.slice(-2200));}\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f0d-3055-7c13-8ac8-f65e99c34ef5","create_time":1792864510.9013379}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:55:12.103Z","ordinal":300197,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f0d-3055-7c13-8ac8-f65e99c34ef5","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16f0d-3055-7c13-8ac8-f65e99c34ef5","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adcf0fc649881a09fde101469459b03","usage":{"input_tokens":86770,"cached_input_tokens":84224,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":319,"reasoning_output_tokens":225,"total_tokens":87089},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":246548,"cached_input_tokens":233216,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":803,"reasoning_output_tokens":483,"total_tokens":247351},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5453140614,"cached_input_tokens":5394805760,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15234565,"reasoning_output_tokens":8700127,"total_tokens":5468375179}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:55:12.106Z","ordinal":300198,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16f0d-686a-7870-9806-c17462c39918","call_id":"call_7bc05165e6164c87b7d790fd4f7dce44","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nList active window identities for a project.\n\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\n\nReturns\n-------\ndict\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts }] }\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"to-generated** — omit ``name`` to get a random adjective+noun\n   identity like ``GreenLake`` or ``BlueDog`` (RECOMMENDED for ad-hoc use).\n\nInvalid examples: \"BackendHarmonizer\", \"DatabaseMigrator\" (descriptive\nrole names are rejected in strict mode).\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    The same human key you passed to `ensure_project` (or equivalent identifier).\nprogram : str\n    The agent program (e.g., \"codex-cli\", \"claude-code\").\nmodel : str\n    The underlying model (e.g., \"gpt5-codex\", \"opus-4.1\").\nname : Optional[str]\n    A valid explicit identity (e.g., \"alpha-one\", \"cc-0\") or adjective+noun\n    combination (e.g., \"BlueLake\").\n    If omitted, a random valid name is auto-generated (RECOMMENDED).\n    Names are unique per project; passing the same name updates the profile.\ntask_description : str\n    Short description of current focus (shows up in directory listings).\n\nReturns\n-------\ndict\n    { id, name, program, model, task_description, inception_ts, last_active_ts, project_id }\n\nExamples\n--------\nRegister with auto-generated name (RECOMMENDED):\n```json\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"3\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"register_agent\",\"arguments\":{\n  \"project_key\":\"/data/projects/backend\",\"program\":\"codex-cli\",\"model\":\"gpt5-codex\",\"task_description\":\"Auth refactor\"\n}}}\n```\n\nRegister with explicit valid name:\n```json\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"4\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"register_agent\",\"arguments\":{\n  \"project_key\":\"/data/projects/backend\",\"program\":\"claude-code\",\"model\":\"opus-4.1\",\"name\":\"BlueLake\",\"task_description\":\"Navbar redesign\"\n}}}\n```\n\nPitfalls\n--------\n- Names MUST match the adjective+noun format or an error will be raised\n- Names are case-insensitive unique. If you see \"already in use\", pick another or omit `name`.\n- Use the same `project_key` consistently across cooperating agents.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent(args: { attachments_policy?: string; format?: string | null; model: string; name?: string | null; program: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; task_description?: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nReturn enriched profile details for an agent, optionally including recent archive commits.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project slug or human key.\nagent_name : str\n    Agent name to look up (use resource://agents/{project_key} to discover names).\ninclude_recent_commits : bool\n    If true, include latest commits touching the project archive authored by the configured git author.\ncommit_limit : int\n    Maximum number of recent commits to include.\n\nReturns\n-------\ndict\n    Agent profile augmented with { recent_commits: [{hexsha, summary, authored_ts}] } when requested.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__whois(args: { agent_name: string; commit_limit?: number; format?: string | null; include_recent_commits?: boolean; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nMacro helper that boots a project session: ensure project, register agent,\noptionally file_reservation paths, and fetch the latest inbox snapshot.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_start_session(args: { agent_name?: string | null; file_reservation_paths?: Array<string> | null; file_reservation_reason?: string; file_reservation_ttl_seconds?: number; format?: string | null; human_key: string; inbox_limit?: number; model: string; program: string; registration_token?: string | null; task_description?: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f0d-3055-7c13-8ac8-f65e99c34ef5","create_time":1792864512.1061573}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
