{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:58:23.143Z","ordinal":300391,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16f10-52a7-7b33-9727-7a9aa9241fd4","call_id":"call_34375e88ac984e05951e62bd59e537e5","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__codex_app__create_thread\nTools provided by the Codex app.\n\nCreate a separate task only when the user explicitly asks for a new task. The prompt appears as a user-visible message in the new task. Write clear, cohesive, human-readable prose. Use project for repositor\n\nmcp__codex_app__fork_thread\nTools provided by the Codex app.\n\nFork a Codex task, including a local Work task. Omit threadId to fork the calling Codex or local Work task. From a ChatGPT-backed cloud Work conversation, provide an explicit Codex threadId; this tool canno\n\nmcp__codex_app__handoff_thread\nTools provided by the Codex app.\n\nMove another Codex thread and its associated git state between its checkout and Codex worktree on its current host. Running threads are interrupted before handoff. Omit destinationHostId for this current-ho\n\nmcp__codex_app__send_message_to_thread\nTools provided by the Codex app.\n\nSend a follow-up prompt to an existing thread or chat only when the user explicitly authorizes messaging that task. Typed or spoken authorization counts. Authorization must come directly from the human user\n\nmcp__codex_apps__github_list_pull_request_review_threads\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\n\nList inline review threads on a pull request, including resolved state. Returns GraphQL review thread nodes, including comment bodies and resolution m\n\nmcp__codex_apps__github_resolve_review_thread\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\n\nResolve an inline pull request review thread. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/mutations#resolvereviewthread. This tool is part of p\n\nmcp__codex_apps__github_unresolve_review_thread\nAccess repositories, issues, and pull requests. Required for some features such as Codex\n\nMark an inline pull request review thread as unresolved. Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/graphql/reference/mutations#unresolvereviewthread. This tool\n\nmcp__codex_apps__gmail_batch_read_email_threads\nGmail tools for label counts, searching and reading emails/threads/attachments, reviewing drafts, and explicit mail changes like send, draft, forward, archive, Trash, and label actions.\n\nRead recent messages from threads identified by messa\n\nmcp__codex_apps__gmail_read_email_thread\nGmail tools for label counts, searching and reading emails/threads/attachments, reviewing drafts, and explicit mail changes like send, draft, forward, archive, Trash, and label actions.\n\nRead the most recent messages in a Gmail thread as he"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f0d-3055-7c13-8ac8-f65e99c34ef5","create_time":1792864703.143401}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
