{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:02:08.934Z","ordinal":300506,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f0d-3055-7c13-8ac8-f65e99c34ef5","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-3ea54774-3af8-4931-98de-a2d83c65b0f7","process_id":"9784","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 199 --json reviews,reviewDecision,latestReviews,mergeStateStatus,title; gh pr view 200 --json reviews,reviewDecision,latestReviews,mergeStateStatus,title; gh pr view 201 --json reviews,reviewDecision,latestReviews,mergeStateStatus,title"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 199 --json reviews,reviewDecision,latestReviews,mergeStateStatus,title; gh pr view 200 --json reviews,reviewDecision,latestReviews,mergeStateStatus,title; gh pr view 201 --json reviews,reviewDecision,latestReviews,mergeStateStatus,title"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"latestReviews\":[],\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUB6AXw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `f3783cf24a59c6ff564cfea3f418b3006600a496`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `core/src/cst.rs` and `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/DEFECT-CST-UNBOUNDED-20261024/README.md`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Bounded Resource Consumption**:\\n   - `read_source_file` helper checks descriptor metadata (`file.metadata()?.len() > MAX_READ_BYTES as u64`), refusing files over 8 MB before reading into memory.\\n   - Reader stream is capped via `.take(MAX_READ_BYTES as u64 + 1)` and re-checked (`content.len() > MAX_READ_BYTES`) to bound heap allocation even under concurrent file expansion.\\n   - `parse_cst_symbols` and `generate_file_outline` route all source file reads through `read_source_file`, eliminating previously unbounded reads in AST and outline generation.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `cst::tests::test_cst_refuses_files_above_the_read_limit`: **PASS**.\\n     - `cst::tests::test_cst_symbol_parsing`: **PASS**.\\n     - Suite passed in 0.06s.\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`41b381d`): **CLEAN** (`270aeb72548a1700bd2e3507ca837e205b6b1d23`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40115982854](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40115982854): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40115982806](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40115982806): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:26:48Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"f3783cf24a59c6ff564cfea3f418b3006600a496\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUB89Qg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `0667947`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `0667947d4e581e8ba996b8cca91438697f640500`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `core/src/cst.rs` and `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/DEFECT-CST-UNBOUNDED-20261024/README.md`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Single-Pass Outline Parsing**:\\n   - Extracted `parse_cst_content` so `generate_file_outline` reads the file only once through `read_source_file` and parses symbols from the bounded in-memory content, eliminating redundant file reads while maintaining strict size bounding.\\n   - Refusal in `generate_file_outline` is validated independently from symbol parsing.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test_cst_symbol_parsing`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_outline_refuses_files_above_the_read_limit`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_refuses_files_above_the_read_limit`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_accepts_the_read_limit_and_empty_files`: **PASS** (exact limit and empty file behavior verified)\\n     - Full `cst` suite (4/4): **PASS** (1.22s).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`41b381d`): **CLEAN** (`79a5448373b98488e0c8b3684a0d9e51240dc5e6`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40116869423](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116869423): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40116869410](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116869410): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:41:44Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"0667947d4e581e8ba996b8cca91438697f640500\"}}],\"title\":\"fix(cst): bound symbol parsing and outline reads\"}\n{\"latestReviews\":[],\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUB9JAQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Idempotent Fail-Closed Git Exclusion**:\\n   - `ensureGitExclude` checks `isIgnored` using `git check-ignore --quiet --no-index`.\\n   - If an exact exclusion rule already exists in `info/exclude` without subsequent negation lines, but Git still reports the path as not ignored (e.g., overridden by a higher-priority repository ignore rule such as in `.gitignore`), it immediately fails closed by throwing an error without continually appending duplicate useless rules to `info/exclude`.\\n   - If a subsequent negation (`!`) is present in `info/exclude`, it appends the verified positive rule to re-establish exclusion and validates ignore status.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (1.03s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`41b381d`): **CLEAN** (`141a1df2122886d1d7a4c9fa71c64668153ff058`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40116819484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819484): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40116819381](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819381): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:42:47Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCDT_A\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `56bc1dc`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362`\\n- **Base Commit**: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Preserved Explicit Subpath Exclusions**:\\n   - Condition updated to `if (hasExactRule && isIgnored(relativePath)) continue;`, ensuring that explicit rules for `.nexus/worktrees/` and `.nexus/flights/` are always written even when Git's parent path resolution already considers them covered by `.nexus/`.\\n   - Idempotency and fail-closed protections are fully maintained: if `hasExactRule` is true and a non-negated rule still fails to ignore the target (e.g., due to repository-level `.gitignore` override), it fails closed without growing `info/exclude`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/flight_exclude.test.ts` (3/3): **PASS** (WorktreeManager exclusions and idempotency verified).\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (11/11 total tests across suites in 2.61s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`ac3e5d3856f364e5f17aedef12d7c881f9aa009b`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118387755](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387755): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118387758](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387758): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:01:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362\"}}],\"title\":\"fix(git): avoid duplicate ineffective exclusion rules\"}\n{\"latestReviews\":[],\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCDn9w\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59`\\n- **Base Commit**: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Composed Sandbox Isolation & Cleanup Regression**:\\n   - Tests end-to-end containment orchestration: staged repository workspace creation, Bubblewrap sandbox invocation via `agentSandboxArgv`, and kernel cgroup containment via `spawnContained`.\\n   - Proves canaries planted in forbidden Git history (`SYNTHETIC_FUTURE_SOLUTION_CANARY_71ad`) and external host paths (`SYNTHETIC_EXTERNAL_VALIDATOR_CANARY_9c32`) are completely unreachable from within the contained process.\\n   - Verifies that detached background descendant processes cannot outlive execution and are reaped upon resource supervisor containment teardown (`lateMarker` check).\\n   - Confirms cgroup limits (`cpu.max`, `memory.max`, `memory.swap.max: 0`, `pids.max`) match configured profiles.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository`: **PASS** (3.86s).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`7cf726433aa40e5773a91f203065ea4277c4e0de`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118467756](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467756): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118467757](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467757): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:02:06Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59\"}}],\"title\":\"test(eval): exercise composed sandbox isolation\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":849844447}},"started_at_ms":1792864926083,"completed_at_ms":1792864928933}}
