` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Composed Sandbox Isolation & Cleanup Regression**:\\n   - Tests end-to-end containment orchestration: staged repository workspace creation, Bubblewrap sandbox invocation via `agentSandboxArgv`, and kernel cgroup containment via `spawnContained`.\\n   - Proves canaries planted in forbidden Git history (`SYNTHETIC_FUTURE_SOLUTION_CANARY_71ad`) and external host paths (`SYNTHETIC_EXTERNAL_VALIDATOR_CANARY_9c32`) are completely unreachable from within the contained process.\\n   - Verifies that detached background descendant processes cannot outlive execution and are reaped upon resource supervisor containment teardown (`lateMarker` check).\\n   - Confirms cgroup limits (`cpu.max`, `memory.max`, `memory.swap.max: 0`, `pids.max`) match configured profiles.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository`: **PASS** (3.86s).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`7cf726433aa40e5773a91f203065ea4277c4e0de`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118467756](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467756): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118467757](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467757): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:02:06Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59\"}}],\"title\":\"test(eval): exercise composed sandbox isolation\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f0d-3055-7c13-8ac8-f65e99c34ef5","create_time":1792864930.8324616}},"me