 \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\\\"\\n  * Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\"\\n  * Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/SHA256SUMS\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/SHA256SUMS\\\"\\n  * Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\"\\n  * Run cyclonedx validate --input-file \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" --fail-on-errors\\n  * Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/sbom.cdx.json\\\"\\n  * Run cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/install.sh\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/install.sh\\\"\\n  * Run bash scripts/smoke-package.sh \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\"\\n  * Run bash scripts/installer-smoke.sh \\\"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/install.sh\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\"\\n  * Run actions/upload-artifact@ea165f8d65b6e75b540449e92b4886f43607fa02\\n  * Post Run actions/setup-node@49933ea5288caeca8642d1e84afbd3f7d6820020\\n  * Post Run actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff\\n  * Post Run actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\\n\\nANNOTATIONS\\n! Node.js 20 is deprecated. The following actions target Node.js 20 but are being forced to run on Node.js 24: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262, actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff, actions/setup-node@49933ea5288caeca8642d1e84afbd3f7d6820020. For more information see: https://github.blog/changelog/2025-09-19-deprecation-of-node-20-on-github-actions-runners/\\ntest-matrix (22): .github#2\\n\\n! Restore cache failed: Dependencies file is not found in /home/runner/work/nexus-code/nexus-code. Supported file pattern: go.sum\\ntest-matrix (22): .github#25\\n\\n