"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-24T18:20:27Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(git): avoid duplicate ineffective exclusion rules\",\"oid\":\"7a84ccf6f56f3ccaeffe2fc7dda19180f8596035\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-24T17:52:25Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-24T18:20:27Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(git): preserve explicit Nexus exclude rules\",\"oid\":\"89d7416fc5a54e3d0d9fd43d70192f12c540f93f\"}],\"headRefName\":\"v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\",\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUB9JAQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Idempotent Fail-Closed Git Exclusion**:\\n   - `ensureGitExclude` checks `isIgnored` using `git check-ignore --quiet --no-index`.\\n   - If an exact exclusion rule already exists in `info/exclude` without subsequent negation lines, but Git still reports the path as not ignored (e.g., overridden by a higher-priority repository ignore rule such as in `.gitignore`), it immediately fails closed by throwing an error without continually appending duplicate useless rules to `info/exclude`.\\n   - If a subsequent negation (`!`) is present in `info/exclude`, it appends the verified positive rule to re-establish exclusion and validates ignore status.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (1.03s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`41b381d`): **CLEAN** (`141a1df2122886d1d7a4c9fa71c64668153ff058`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40116819484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819484): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40116819381](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819381): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:42:47Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCDT_A\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `56bc1dc`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362`\\n- **Base Commit**: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Preserved Explicit Subpath Exclusions**:\\n   - Condition updated to `if (hasExactRule && isIgnored(relativePath)) continue;`, ensuring that explicit rules for `.nexus/worktrees/` and `.nexus/flights/` are always written even when Git's parent path resolution already considers them covered by `.nexus/`.\\n   - Idempotency and fail-closed protections are fully maintained: if `hasExactRule` is true and a non-negated rule still fails to ignore the target (e.g., due to repository-level `.gitignore` override), it fails closed without growing `info/exclude`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/flight_exclude.test.ts` (3/3): **PASS** (WorktreeManager exclusions and idempotency verified).\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (11/11 total tests across suites in 2.61s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`ac3e5d3856f364e5f17aedef12d7c881f9aa009b`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118387755](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387755): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118387758](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387758): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:01:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362\"}}]}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-24T17:50:33Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-24T18:21:55Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"test(eval): compose candidate sandbox with resource limits\",\"oid\":\"281014f5888a927fbcee41a6a11aebbcb732b726\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-24T17:54:29Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-24T18:21:55Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"test(eval): await containment cleanup on fixture failure\",\"oid\":\"b0240b43aaad16df9c2663218949970c4dac513b\"}],\"headRefName\":\"v1/plan-10-eval-composed-sandbox-fixture\",\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCDn9w\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59`\\n- **Base Commit**: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Composed Sandbox Isolation & Cleanup Regression**:\\n   - Tests end-to-end containment orchestration: staged repository workspace creation, Bubblewrap sandbox invocation via `agentSandboxArgv`, and kernel cgroup containment via `spawnContained`.\\n   - Proves canaries planted in forbidden Git history (`SYNTHETIC_FUTURE_SOLUTION_CANARY_71ad`) and external host paths (`SYNTHETIC_EXTERNAL_VALIDATOR_CANARY_9c32`) are completely unreachable from within the contained process.\\n   - Verifies that detached background descendant processes cannot outlive execution and are reaped upon resource supervisor containment teardown (`lateMarker` check).\\n   - Confirms cgroup limits (`cpu.max`, `memory.max`, `memory.swap.max: 0`, `pids.max`) match configured profiles.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository`: **PASS** (3.86s).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`7cf726433aa40e5773a91f203065ea4277c4e0de`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118467756](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467756): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118467757](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467757): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:02:06Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59\"}}]}\n## main...origin/main [behind 949]\n M AGENTS.md\n M cli/dist/agent.js\n M cli/src/agent.ts\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\nA  scripts/