lude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Preserved Explicit Subpath Exclusions**:\\n   - Condition updated to `if (hasExactRule && isIgnored(relativePath)) continue;`, ensuring that explicit rules for `.nexus/worktrees/` and `.nexus/flights/` are always written even when Git's parent path resolution already considers them covered by `.nexus/`.\\n   - Idempotency and fail-closed protections are fully maintained: if `hasExactRule` is true and a non-negated rule still fails to ignore the target (e.g., due to repository-level `.gitignore` override), it fails closed without growing `info/exclude`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/flight_exclude.test.ts` (3/3): **PASS** (WorktreeManager exclusions and idempotency verified).\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (11/11 total tests across suites in 2.61s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`ac3e5d3856f364e5f17aedef12d7c881f9aa009b`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118387755](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387755): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118387758](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387758): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:01:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362\"}}]}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-24T17:50:33Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-24T18:21:55Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messa