{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:33:36.719Z","ordinal":302002,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f2a-3ce8-7e02-bf87-a11cb7ed706b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcf9ffe14c81a0a1f8830ce4d58414","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"A new review finding changes the next action: Claude’s review says PR #200 can prevent Nexus from starting when `.git/info/exclude` is unwritable, even though the user only launched the app. I’m addressing that within the existing PR #200 ownership: defer the Git metadata write until Nexus actually creates worktree state, and add a regression test for startup plus fail-closed behavior at the write point."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792866815912,"completed_at_ms":1792866816719}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:33:36.722Z","ordinal":302003,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcf9ffe14c81a0a1f8830ce4d58414","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"A new review finding changes the next action: Claude’s review says PR #200 can prevent Nexus from starting when `.git/info/exclude` is unwritable, even though the user only launched the app. I’m addressing that within the existing PR #200 ownership: defer the Git metadata write until Nexus actually creates worktree state, and add a regression test for startup plus fail-closed behavior at the write point.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f2a-3ce8-7e02-bf87-a11cb7ed706b","create_time":1792866815.8828974,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcf9ffe14c81a0a1f8830ce4d58414","turn_id":"01a16f2a-3ce8-7e02-bf87-a11cb7ed706b","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a16f30-92d2-76f3-979d-3d6eac5b23ac","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15380}}
