eeManager construction to actual worktree creation; regression tests for non-mutating startup and fail-closed first write\",\"status\":\"claimed; boundary extension recorded for PR200; within PLAN-08 first-workspace-write responsibility\"}\n\n--- FILE_cli_test_flight_exclude.test.ts\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed\",\"base\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"since\":\"2026-10-24T18:34:24Z\",\"scope\":\"PR200 review correction: defer .nexus Git exclusion mutation from WorktreeManager construction to actual worktree creation; regression tests for non-mutating startup and fail-closed first write\",\"status\":\"claimed; boundary extension recorded for PR200; within PLAN-08 first-workspace-write responsibility\"}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\\n- Add a regression that retries the ineffective rule and verifies the exclude file no longer grows.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `npx tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts`: 8/8 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact diff SHA-256 `9518852b8ad6f9c2242a8b08f7b661925beed1d492f72847a75216dae17ec8f1`.\\n- Exact-head CI is required before integration.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n- `main` at `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b`.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/200\"}\njavascript-typescript\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholown