{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:41:46.574Z","ordinal":302475,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adcfbe80c3481a097a9848c57d3fbe2","status":"completed","call_id":"call_91d5950b81ba4dfca01b6dffb20c3fd1","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/pr200-body.md <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\\n- Defer exclusion-file mutation from `WorktreeManager` construction until an actual worktree is created. Startup remains non-mutating, while worktree creation checks the exclusion before creating `.nexus/worktrees` and fails closed if Git metadata is unavailable.\\n- Add regressions for retry behavior, non-mutating manager construction, and fail-closed worktree creation.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts test/flight_exclude.test.ts`: 12/12 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact head `dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069`, diff SHA-256 `c0705f527e3a05a38b12ec0680708f98a2819978c0a6e934b881ec09748f2fe0`.\\n- Fresh exact-head CI is pending and required before integration.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n- `main` at `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468`.\\nEOF\\ngh pr edit 200 --body-file /tmp/pr200-body.md\\ngh pr view 200 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,body\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:2500}); text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f37-6e05-7dc2-8c28-9b80ae02e75f","create_time":1792867304.049952}}}
