{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:41:49.669Z","ordinal":302477,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f37-6e05-7dc2-8c28-9b80ae02e75f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-2b3b295e-0d34-4c2a-84b0-e11fdf919086","process_id":"90088","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat > /tmp/pr200-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\n- Defer exclusion-file mutation from `WorktreeManager` construction until an actual worktree is created. Startup remains non-mutating, while worktree creation checks the exclusion before creating `.nexus/worktrees` and fails closed if Git metadata is unavailable.\n- Add regressions for retry behavior, non-mutating manager construction, and fail-closed worktree creation.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts test/flight_exclude.test.ts`: 12/12 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact head `dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069`, diff SHA-256 `c0705f527e3a05a38b12ec0680708f98a2819978c0a6e934b881ec09748f2fe0`.\n- Fresh exact-head CI is pending and required before integration.\n\n## Base\n\n- `main` at `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468`.\nEOF\ngh pr edit 200 --body-file /tmp/pr200-body.md\ngh pr view 200 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,body"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat > /tmp/pr200-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\n- Defer exclusion-file mutation from `WorktreeManager` construction until an actual worktree is created. Startup remains non-mutating, while worktree creation checks the exclusion before creating `.nexus/worktrees` and fails closed if Git metadata is unavailable.\n- Add regressions for retry behavior, non-mutating manager construction, and fail-closed worktree creation.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts test/flight_exclude.test.ts`: 12/12 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact head `dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069`, diff SHA-256 `c0705f527e3a05a38b12ec0680708f98a2819978c0a6e934b881ec09748f2fe0`.\n- Fresh exact-head CI is pending and required before integration.\n\n## Base\n\n- `main` at `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468`.\nEOF\ngh pr edit 200 --body-file /tmp/pr200-body.md\ngh pr view 200 --json headRefOid,baseRefOid,body"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/200\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\\n- Still append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\\n- Defer exclusion-file mutation from `WorktreeManager` construction until an actual worktree is created. Startup remains non-mutating, while worktree creation checks the exclusion before creating `.nexus/worktrees` and fails closed if Git metadata is unavailable.\\n- Add regressions for retry behavior, non-mutating manager construction, and fail-closed worktree creation.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `node --import tsx --test test/git_exclude.test.ts test/flight_exclude.test.ts`: 12/12 passed with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact head `dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069`, diff SHA-256 `c0705f527e3a05a38b12ec0680708f98a2819978c0a6e934b881ec09748f2fe0`.\\n- Fresh exact-head CI is pending and required before integration.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n- `main` at `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468`.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":971143487}},"started_at_ms":1792867307697,"completed_at_ms":1792867309669}}
