{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:42:24.381Z","ordinal":302511,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f37-6e05-7dc2-8c28-9b80ae02e75f","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adcfc0fa62081a084a1f950d4c3404f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"PR #200 now points at `dfea9e2`; GitHub started a fresh test matrix and CodeQL for that exact head. The prior main CI on `4adc61a` is also still in progress. I’m checking the other two release-critical open PRs next so I can advance any that already have the required review and checks, while the corpus custody lane remains untouched."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792867343706,"completed_at_ms":1792867344381}}
