ych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `8d2288e9a4f139bf88dffd33c643869899166bd8`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `core/src/cst.rs` and `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/DEFECT-CST-UNBOUNDED-20261024/README.md`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Elimination of Line Allocation Amplification**:\\n   - Replaced `content.lines().map(|line| line.to_string()).collect::<Vec<String>>()` with borrowed source lines via `content.lines().enumerate()` and a 9-line `VecDeque` lookahead window.\\n   - For an 8 MiB newline-dense input, this avoids allocating ~8 million `String` structs on the heap while preserving the multi-line signature lookahead window.\\n   - Documentation comments now accumulate into a single `String` buffer rather than a per-line `Vec<String>`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test_cst_symbol_parsing`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_outline_refuses_files_above_the_read_limit`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_refuses_files_above_the_read_limit`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_accepts_the_read_limit_and_empty_files`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_handles_newline_dense_file_at_read_limit_without_line_allocations`: **PASS**\\n     - 5/5 CST tests passing cleanly in 11.18s.\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`4c131f12886d01af438ed29825de8527d8479d42`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40120241400](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241400): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40120241547](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241547): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:22:55Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"8d2288e9a4f139bf88dffd33c643869899166bd8\"}}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:37:01Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241547/job/120950010136\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:20:27Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:21:41Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241400/job/120950009704\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:20:27Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:36:45Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241547/job/120950009878\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:20:27Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241547/job/120953910247\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:37:04Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:21:34Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/120950269011\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:21:31Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:20:31Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"}],\"title\":\"fix(cst): avoid line allocation amplification\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/202\"}\n"}