epancy before any new suite or post-merge workflow., checkpoint_fix_integrated=PR153 merged 2026-10-23T02:44:43Z; merge commit main 429bd3141b422ca38df19745d733588cc92901c4, includes independently accepted REPL prompt parity fix. Exact PR head 250dd96 CI39888390485 SUCCESS (Node22, Node24, Linux package/repro/CLI suite); CodeQL39888390479 SUCCESS; focused 4/4; requirements enforcement passed on base fa16045. Post-merge main CI39891244410 and CodeQL39891244389 active on exact merge commit. PR154 readiness documentation remains open at c033b38 on old base fa16045; old exact checks in Linux packaging stage, and refresh is needed after current main CI. No RC tag or release., pr154=Merged as 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Post-merge CodeQL 39891501527 SUCCESS, Node22/24 CI SUCCESS, Linux CI 39891501513 still in npm cli test at 2026-10-23 03:14 UTC. Coordination log latest confirms SUITE claim released after independent focused tests (5/5) on PR155 lane; do not start full local suite while hosted Linux test active. PR155 exact head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30 against main 382e018; independent ACCEPT; CodeQL pass; Node 22/24 checks running. Issue #1 remains open; latest comment remains metadata-only request 2026-10-22T22:08:34Z; no custodian response., doctor_d1b_candidate=Uncommitted change in isolated worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/doctor-integrity-scan, branch v1/doctor-integrity-scan, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. State scan now lstat batches capped at 128; regression test instruments 512 records and delays lstat 20ms to expose serial-timeout behavior. diff-check PASS. Tests queued until SUITE release; independent read-only review requested., current_ci=39891501513 on exact main 382e018 in_progress Node22/24 CLI test. 39891501527 CodeQL SUCCESS. Prior merge CI39891244410 on 429bd314 Node22/24 SUCCESS, linux setup active; not merged-head evidence for current main., doctor_root_cause_reconciled=Current main includes PR151: D1 event-loop starvation fixed, D2 index/schema2 false warning fixed, D3 unlisted gateway model now advisory with --deep verification. Remaining measured D1b: async serial lstat over 53,376 entries still makes integrity.check exceed 5s and warn. Focused concurrent-batch fix underway; not yet tested., doctor_d1b_pr=PR #155 opened at https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/155; head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Independent review ACCEPT. Focused doctor tests 5/5 and tsc --noEmit pass. Exact PR CI run39893335185 and CodeQL39893335167 in progress. No merge yet., main_latest_ci=Run39891501513 exact main 382e018: Node22 and Node24 full suites SUCCESS; Linux package job still in progress. CodeQL39891501527 SUCCESS. Prior PR153 post-merge run39891244410 on 429bd314 remains historical and Linux packaging in progress; not needed to combine with current-main evidence., custody_refresh=Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-22T22:08:35Z. No custodian response; 40-task manifest custody acceptance\\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]\"}]}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"--- authors\n{\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"},\"headRefName\":\"v1/plan-10-eval-composed-sandbox-fixture\",\"headRefOid\":\"b0240b43aaad16df9c2663218949970c4dac513b\"}\n{\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"},\"headRefName\":\"v1/defect-cst-memory-followup\",\"headRefOid\":\"8d2288e9a4f139bf88dffd33c643869899166bd8\"}\n{\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"},\"headRefName\":\"v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\",\"headRefOid\":\"dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f37-6e05-7dc2-8c28-9b80ae02e75f","create_time":17928673