{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:43:52.718Z","ordinal":302596,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f37-6e05-7dc2-8c28-9b80ae02e75f","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a16f37-6e05-7dc2-8c28-9b80ae02e75f","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adcfc669f5881a08a0c5fb52bb7062c","usage":{"input_tokens":173934,"cached_input_tokens":172800,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":174,"reasoning_output_tokens":90,"total_tokens":174108},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":2653264,"cached_input_tokens":2602240,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":12540,"reasoning_output_tokens":7399,"total_tokens":2665804},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":5492010412,"cached_input_tokens":5433183104,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15407746,"reasoning_output_tokens":8814662,"total_tokens":5507418158}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:43:52.721Z","ordinal":302597,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a16f39-f911-7b23-9b2b-068af2dbf948","call_id":"call_9e518d0306404d6da79bceb4f8f53b11","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nsince_hours : float\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\nlimit : int\n    Maximum summaries to return (default 5).\nformat : str, optional\n    Output format.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary(args: { format?: string | null; limit?: number; project_key: string; since_hours?: number; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nFetch all messages in a project with a given topic tag, regardless of recipient.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\ntopic_name : str\n    The topic tag to filter by (case-insensitive).\nlimit : int\n    Max number of messages to return (default 50).\ninclude_bodies : bool\n    Include full Markdown bodies in the payloads (default true).\nsince_ts : Optional[str]\n    ISO-8601 timestamp; only messages newer than this are returned.\n\nReturns\n-------\nlist[dict]\n    Each message includes: { id, subject, from, created_ts, importance, topic, [body_md] }\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic(args: { agent_name?: string | null; format?: string | null; include_bodies?: boolean; limit?: number; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; since_ts?: string | null; topic_name: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\n```"},{"type":"input_text","text":"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nFull-text search over subject and body for a project.\n\nTips\n----\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\"build plan\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\n- Results are ordered by bm25 score (best matches first)\n- Limit defaults to 20; raise for broad queries\n\nQuery examples\n---------------\n- Phrase search: `\"build plan\"`\n- Prefix: `migrat*`\n- Boolean: `plan AND users`\n- Require urgent: `urgent AND deployment`\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_key : str\n    Project identifier.\nquery : str\n    FTS5 query string.\nlimit : int\n    Max results to return.\n\nReturns\n-------\nlist[dict]\n    Each entry: { id, subject, importance, ack_required, created_ts, thread_id, from }\n\nExample\n-------\n```json\n{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"10\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"search_messages\",\"arguments\":{\n  \"project_key\":\"/abs/path/backend\",\"query\":\"\"build plan\" AND users\", \"limit\": 50\n}}}\n```\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages(args: { agent_name?: string | null; format?: string | null; limit?: number; project_key: string; query: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\n```"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16f37-6e05-7dc2-8c28-9b80ae02e75f","create_time":1792867432.7213368}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
