\n   - Tests end-to-end containment orchestration: staged repository workspace creation, Bubblewrap sandbox invocation via `agentSandboxArgv`, and kernel cgroup containment via `spawnContained`.\\n   - Proves canaries planted in forbidden Git history (`SYNTHETIC_FUTURE_SOLUTION_CANARY_71ad`) and external host paths (`SYNTHETIC_EXTERNAL_VALIDATOR_CANARY_9c32`) are completely unreachable from within the contained process.\\n   - Verifies that detached background descendant processes cannot outlive execution and are reaped upon resource supervisor containment teardown (`lateMarker` check).\\n   - Confirms cgroup limits (`cpu.max`, `memory.max`, `memory.swap.max: 0`, `pids.max`) match configured profiles.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository`: **PASS** (3.86s).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`7cf726433aa40e5773a91f203065ea4277c4e0de`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118467756](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467756): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118467757](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467757): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:02:06Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCKJUA\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Rebased Head `b0240b4`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `b0240b43aaad16df9c2663218949970c4dac513b`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Rebase Integrity**:\\n   - Clean rebase onto `main@4adc61a`, resolving base divergence after merge of PR #199.\\n   - Retains exact composed sandbox isolation suite with Bubblewrap + cgroup resource limits, canary leakage detection, and detached descendant process cleanup.\\n2. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`1795917c6f2cf69fb9ba36f14de05378ed7bb5b1`).\\n3. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run: active.\\n   - CI Run: active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:23:54Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"b0240b43aaad16df9c2663218949970c4dac513b\"}}]}\n{\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewRequests\":[],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCJ9pw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `8d2288e9a4f139bf88dffd33c643869899166bd8`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `core/src/cst.rs` and `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/DEFECT-CST-UNBOUNDED-20261024/README.md`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Elimination of Line Allocation Amplification**:\\n   - Replaced `content.lines().map(|line| line.to_string()).collect::<Vec<String>>()` with borrowed source lines via `content.lines().enumerate()` and a 9-line `VecDeque` lookahead window.\\n   - For an 8 MiB newline-dense input, this avoids allocating ~8 million `String` structs on the heap while preserving the multi-line signature lookahead window.\\n   - Documentation comments now accumulate into a single `String` buffer rather than a per-line `Vec<String>`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test_cst_symbol_parsing`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_outline_refuses_files_above_the_read_limit`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_refuses_files_above_the_read_limit`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_accepts_the_read_limit_and_empty_files`: **PASS**\\n     - `test_cst_handles_newline_dense_file_at_read_limit_without_line_allocations`: **PASS**\\n     - 5/5 CST tests passing cleanly in 11.18s.\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`4c131f12886d01af438ed29825de8527d8479d42`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40120241400](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241400): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40120241547](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120241547): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:22:55Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"8d2288e9a4f139bf88dffd33c643869899166bd8\"}}]}\n{\n  \"agent\": \"/root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-23T08:21:16Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Release coordination and versioning/RC lifecycle preparation; preserve exact-source, installed-RC, independent and human acceptance gates.\",\n  \"status\": \"main=4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468; requirements --enforce historical exact-main PASS 123 rows with 12 exact-RC gates; main CI40119819717 still active, CodeQL40119819576 SUCCESS. PR200 head dfea9e2 exact independent ACCEPT, focused 12/12, fresh CI40121865583/CodeQL40121865676 queued. PR201 head b0240b4 independent ACCEPT, Node22/24 and CodeQL pass, linux-x86_64 active. PR202 head 8d2288e independent ACCEPT reviewer plan05_readonly_review, Node22/24 and CodeQL pass, linux-x86_64 active. RC5 notes candidate 1e295f9 only covers already merged changes; rebase/update after integration. No version bump/tag/publication. Acceptance IN_PROGRESS; held-out custody/runner compatibility and human terminal qualification remain open.\",\n  \"head\": \"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-24T19:10:00Z\"\n}\ncat: .git/nexus-claims/PLAN-10_EVAL_COMPOSED_SANDBOX_FIXTURE/owner.json: No such file or directory\n","exit_code":1,"duration":{"secs":4,"nanos":174478628}},"started_at_ms":1792867669395,"completed_at_ms":1792867673571}}
