history and an external validator store, then checks that task execution cannot retrieve either. It also verifies the configured resource envelope and supervisor cleanup behavior.\\n\\nThe fixture uses synthetic data only; it does not access or expose held-out task payloads.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- Base: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef`\\n- Candidate head: `dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59`\\n- Patch SHA-256: `27516531b17dee24e1335280cb45bf1e57d26b32b3f415b0a8469cc3cdaebe28`\\n- Focused fixture: 1/1 passed with isolated HOME/XDG.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact head and patch hash.\\n\\nFull exact-head CI is required before integration. This test does not constitute held-out qualification or release acceptance.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"b0240b43aaad16df9c2663218949970c4dac513b\",\"mergeCommit\":null,\"mergeStateStatus\":\"CLEAN\",\"number\":201,\"reviews\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `dfb3880d43fb2ba5574c8ac42221cfe4d138fe59`\\n- **Base Commit**: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Composed Sandbox Isolation \\u0026 Cleanup Regression**:\\n   - Tests end-to-end containment orchestration: staged repository workspace creation, Bubblewrap sandbox invocation via `agentSandboxArgv`, and kernel cgroup containment via `spawnContained`.\\n   - Proves canaries planted in forbidden Git history (`SYNTHETIC_FUTURE_SOLUTION_CANARY_71ad`) and external host paths (`SYNTHETIC_EXTERNAL_VALIDATOR_CANARY_9c32`) are completely unreachable from within the contained process.\\n   - Verifies that detached background descendant processes cannot outlive execution and are reaped upon resource supervisor containment teardown (`lateMarker` check).\\n   - Confirms cgroup limits (`cpu.max`, `memory.max`, `memory.swap.max: 0`, `pids.max`) match configured profiles.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `candidate sandbox and resource supervisor compose around a staged repository`: **PASS** (3.86s).\\n3. **Static \\u0026 Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`7cf726433aa40e5773a91f203065ea4277c4e0de`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118467756](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467756): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118467757](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118467757): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:02:06Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Rebased Head `b0240b4`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `b0240b43aaad16df9c2663218949970c4dac513b`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Rebase Integrity**:\\n   - Clean rebase onto `main@4adc61a`, resolving base divergence after merge of PR #199.\\n   - Retains exact composed sandbox isolation suite with Bubblewrap + cgroup resource limits, canary leakage detection, and detached descendant process cleanup.\\n2. **Static \\u0026 Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`1795917c6f2cf69fb9ba36f14de05378ed7bb5b1`).\\n3. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run: active.\\n   - CI Run: active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:23:54Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\"}\n27516531b17dee24e1335280cb45bf1e57d26b32b3f415b0a8469cc3cdaebe28  -\n771:2026-10-18T13:26:44Z RECONCILE CLAIMS (ans