{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:59:18.204Z","ordinal":303268,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16f46-cf09-7e22-a063-c93ab614b13a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c3ed326c-b240-4e2b-bbcb-e5db70aa5791","process_id":"23930","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git fetch origin main && git rev-parse origin/main && git show -s --format='%H %cs %s' origin/main && gh pr view 201 --json state,mergedAt,mergeCommit,headRefOid,baseRefOid && gh pr view 202 --json state,mergedAt,mergeCommit,headRefOid,baseRefOid && gh pr view 200 --json state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup,body,reviews,comments --jq '{state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}],reviews:[.reviews[]|{state,submittedAt,commit:.commit.oid,body}],lastComment:.comments[-1]}' && gh run list --branch main --limit 5 --json databaseId,headSha,status,conclusion,workflowName,createdAt,displayTitle"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git fetch origin main && git rev-parse origin/main && git show -s --format='%H %cs %s' origin/main && gh pr view 201 --json state,mergedAt,mergeCommit,headRefOid,baseRefOid && gh pr view 202 --json state,mergedAt,mergeCommit,headRefOid,baseRefOid && gh pr view 200 --json state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,statusCheckRollup,body,reviews,comments --jq '{state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name,status,conclusion}],reviews:[.reviews[]|{state,submittedAt,commit:.commit.oid,body}],lastComment:.comments[-1]}' && gh run list --branch main --limit 5 --json databaseId,headSha,status,conclusion,workflowName,createdAt,displayTitle"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"From https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code\n * branch            main       -> FETCH_HEAD\n29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13\n29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13 2026-10-24 Merge pull request #202 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-cst-memory-followup\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"headRefOid\":\"b0240b43aaad16df9c2663218949970c4dac513b\",\"mergeCommit\":{\"oid\":\"7525659361d0d90de50f065a32558809f9aa8b87\"},\"mergedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:58:25Z\",\"state\":\"MERGED\"}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"headRefOid\":\"8d2288e9a4f139bf88dffd33c643869899166bd8\",\"mergeCommit\":{\"oid\":\"29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13\"},\"mergedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:59:07Z\",\"state\":\"MERGED\"}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":null,\"status\":null}],\"headRefOid\":\"506cf1150859d496e1ee5f2fe31bdade3d23e65a\",\"lastComment\":{\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"I see the current branch head is `dfea9e2`, while its owning worktree has newer uncommitted edits to `git_exclude.ts` and the focused tests addressing the startup/read-only `info/exclude` review finding. Please confirm whether you are still working this slice. At a safe boundary, either commit/push the correction for fresh review or explicitly release/transfer the claim. I will preserve your worktree and not edit it while ownership is unresolved.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:49:56Z\",\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfMN9tA\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/200#issuecomment-6388153780\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"reviews\":[{\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Idempotent Fail-Closed Git Exclusion**:\\n   - `ensureGitExclude` checks `isIgnored` using `git check-ignore --quiet --no-index`.\\n   - If an exact exclusion rule already exists in `info/exclude` without subsequent negation lines, but Git still reports the path as not ignored (e.g., overridden by a higher-priority repository ignore rule such as in `.gitignore`), it immediately fails closed by throwing an error without continually appending duplicate useless rules to `info/exclude`.\\n   - If a subsequent negation (`!`) is present in `info/exclude`, it appends the verified positive rule to re-establish exclusion and validates ignore status.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (1.03s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static \\u0026 Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`41b381d`): **CLEAN** (`141a1df2122886d1d7a4c9fa71c64668153ff058`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40116819484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819484): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40116819381](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819381): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"commit\":\"18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:42:47Z\"},{\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `56bc1dc`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362`\\n- **Base Commit**: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Preserved Explicit Subpath Exclusions**:\\n   - Condition updated to `if (hasExactRule \\u0026\\u0026 isIgnored(relativePath)) continue;`, ensuring that explicit rules for `.nexus/worktrees/` and `.nexus/flights/` are always written even when Git's parent path resolution already considers them covered by `.nexus/`.\\n   - Idempotency and fail-closed protections are fully maintained: if `hasExactRule` is true and a non-negated rule still fails to ignore the target (e.g., due to repository-level `.gitignore` override), it fails closed without growing `info/exclude`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/flight_exclude.test.ts` (3/3): **PASS** (WorktreeManager exclusions and idempotency verified).\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (11/11 total tests across suites in 2.61s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static \\u0026 Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`ac3e5d3856f364e5f17aedef12d7c881f9aa009b`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118387755](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387755): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118387758](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387758): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"commit\":\"56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:01:15Z\"},{\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Rebased Head `89d7416`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `89d7416fc5a54e3d0d9fd43d70192f12c540f93f`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Rebase Integrity**:\\n   - Clean rebase onto `main@4adc61a`, resolving base divergence after merge of PR #199.\\n   - Preserves all 11 explicit Nexus exclude tests, idempotence assertions, and `hasExactRule \\u0026\\u0026 isIgnored` logic.\\n2. **Static \\u0026 Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`4c131f12886d01af438ed29825de8527d8479d42`).\\n3. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40120298213](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120298213): active.\\n   - CI Run [40120298254](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120298254): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"commit\":\"89d7416fc5a54e3d0d9fd43d70192f12c540f93f\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:23:14Z\"},{\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `dfea9e2`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `dfea9e2d9361adbcab662a6e9a66d8ba0e2e5dfb`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts`, `cli/src/worktree.ts`, `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`, and `cli/test/flight_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Deferred Exclusion Mutation**:\\n   - `WorktreeManager` construction is now strictly read-only with respect to Git metadata (`.git/info/exclude`), preserving the invariant that starting a Nexus session does not prematurely mutate repo state.\\n   - Exclusion is executed immediately prior to actual workspace state creation in `createWorktree()`.\\n   - New regression tests verify:\\n     - `WorktreeManager defers .nexus exclusion until it creates workspace state`: verifies initial metadata untouched on construction, then excluded upon `createWorktree()`.\\n     - `unavailable exclude metadata does not prevent startup and fails before worktree state is written`: verifies preflight failure prevents creating `.nexus` workspace directory.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - 12/12 `flight_exclude` and `git_exclude` tests: **PASS** (1.49s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static \\u0026 Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`b43729e2467d341990c0ef497cb730c4e09ef2be`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40120298213](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120298213): **`✓ SUCCESS`**.\\n   - CI Run: active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"commit\":\"dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:46:02Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\"}\n[{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:59:10Z\",\"databaseId\":40123199130,\"displayTitle\":\"Merge pull request #202 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-cst-memory-followup\",\"headSha\":\"29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:59:10Z\",\"databaseId\":40123199081,\"displayTitle\":\"Merge pull request #202 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-cst-memory-followup\",\"headSha\":\"29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:58:28Z\",\"databaseId\":40123150032,\"displayTitle\":\"Merge pull request #201 from mikeholownych/v1/plan-10-eval-composed-s…\",\"headSha\":\"7525659361d0d90de50f065a32558809f9aa8b87\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:58:27Z\",\"databaseId\":40123149991,\"displayTitle\":\"Merge pull request #201 from mikeholownych/v